# game/emmasoloending.rpy:2
translate chinese emmasoloending_53254867:

    # yt "No, I shouldn't even think like that. I made a promise, and I must keep it."
    yt "不，我甚至都不该有这种想法。我许下了承诺，就一定要做到。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3
translate chinese emmasoloending_bc62081d:

    # yt "We have both been waiting for this. And if I have to sacrifice everything to achieve it, so be it. But, there's still something she doesn't know..."
    yt "我们俩都在等这一天。哪怕我要牺牲一切，也可以。但是，还有一些事她并不知道……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:6
translate chinese emmasoloending_c4655ec4:

    # mc "Look, Em..."
    mc "听我说，小艾……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:7
translate chinese emmasoloending_491cb946:

    # mc "There's something that I need to tell you."
    mc "我有事情必须告诉你。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:8
translate chinese emmasoloending_04105cf9:

    # mc "It's about my [landlord]..."
    mc "是关于我[landlord!t]的……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:17
translate chinese emmasoloending_029f7009:

    # e "Your [landlord]?"
    e "你[landlord!t]？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:18
translate chinese emmasoloending_f800bed0:

    # mc "Yes."
    mc "是的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:19
translate chinese emmasoloending_2d80cbec:

    # mc "He's... the one who started this mess."
    mc "他……是所有事的开端。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:20
translate chinese emmasoloending_ec8ece70:

    # mc "Everything that happened in the past was because of him."
    mc "过去发生的事都是因他而起。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:21
translate chinese emmasoloending_980c84ad:

    # mc "Me, my [landlady], Aine, Hera, and you became victims of his actions."
    mc "我，我的[landlady!t]，艾妮，赫拉还有你，都成了他做的事的受害者。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:22
translate chinese emmasoloending_1617c1a8:

    # e "Huh? W-what did he do?"
    e "啊？他-他做了什么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:23
translate chinese emmasoloending_c939c180:

    # mc "He killed Aine's father and..."
    mc "他杀了艾妮的爸爸和……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:24
translate chinese emmasoloending_4ba80ad1:

    # mc "*squirms*"
    mc "*紧张地摇动身体*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:25
translate chinese emmasoloending_ad14f8d4:

    # mc "... Her little brother..."
    mc "……和她弟弟……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:28
translate chinese emmasoloending_ee8e4389:

    # e "{b}*gasps*{/b}"
    e "{b}*惊讶*{/b}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:29
translate chinese emmasoloending_2ddb8854:

    # e "So, that's why Hera..."
    e "所以，赫拉才……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:30
translate chinese emmasoloending_0d9cd5f2:

    # mc "Yes, she changed because of that."
    mc "是的，她之后就变成现在这样了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:31
translate chinese emmasoloending_bba20d64:

    # e "I... never knew."
    e "我……从来都不知道。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:34
translate chinese emmasoloending_1af12ec2:

    # mc "Well, the old woman decided to keep it to herself."
    mc "因为那个老太婆一直憋着不说。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:35
translate chinese emmasoloending_57c4ba7b:

    # mc "That's also the reason why she tormented me."
    mc "她折磨我也是这个原因。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:36
translate chinese emmasoloending_7d174069:

    # mc "Part of it was for revenge, and the rest was in hopes of bringing my [landlord] out of hiding."
    mc "既是为了报仇，也是为了逼我[landlord!t]现身。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:37
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:38
translate chinese emmasoloending_e317f2da:

    # mc "That's why I want to find him and make him finish what he started."
    mc "所以我才想找到他，让他收拾他留下的烂摊子。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:41
translate chinese emmasoloending_e96f6a5a:

    # e "It's going to be a challenge, [mc]. You don't have any clues about his whereabouts, right?"
    e "会很难的，[mc!t]。你根本不知道他在哪，对吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:42
translate chinese emmasoloending_408167d3:

    # mc "I don't..."
    mc "是的……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:43
translate chinese emmasoloending_59724911:

    # mc "And... I don't think I need to do that anymore..."
    mc "但……我觉得我已经没必要去找他了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:44
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:45
translate chinese emmasoloending_18c03d8f:

    # mc "I made a promise and want to keep it, now that I have an opportunity. I don't care what the circumstances are."
    mc "我许下过承诺，现在有了机会，我想将其兑现。我不在乎眼下的情况如何了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:46
translate chinese emmasoloending_de02ca88:

    # mc "This is such a heavy choice I'm about to make, and I know I'm going to hurt a lot of people in the process..."
    mc "我要做的这个决定无比重大，我也知道会伤害到很多人……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:47
translate chinese emmasoloending_1ea4ecde:

    # mc "But, let's run away, Em. Run away from all of this."
    mc "但是……我们一起离开吧，小艾。不要再管这些事了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:48
translate chinese emmasoloending_3b0f7a22:

    # mc "Let's establish our own life. The life that we both wanted since we were kids."
    mc "我们去过自己的生活。那种从我们小时候就一直想要的生活。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:51
translate chinese emmasoloending_6a9c910b:

    # e "R-run away? But... how about..."
    e "离-离开？可是……还有……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:52
translate chinese emmasoloending_34a20107:

    # mc "Yeah, I know..."
    mc "是啊，我懂……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:53
translate chinese emmasoloending_23f5005f:

    # mc "I have a lot to do after hearing what Hera said. But, now that you're here, I don't care anymore."
    mc "在听了赫拉的话之后，我有很多事要做。但有你在，我已经不再在乎那些了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:54
translate chinese emmasoloending_ad655e3e:

    # mc "All I want to think about is you and our future together."
    mc "我只想考虑我们俩的将来。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:57
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_1:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:60
translate chinese emmasoloending_d0d033b9:

    # e "I'm so happy to hear that, [mc]."
    e "我真的好开心，[mc!t]。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:61
translate chinese emmasoloending_cce6af05:

    # e "I want to be with you – I said that many times. Too many to even count. But, there is a lot that we must sacrifice if we are to leave everything behind..."
    e "我想和你在一起；我已经说过很多遍了。多到数不过来。但我们如果要把一切都丢下的话，要牺牲的东西就太多了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:64
translate chinese emmasoloending_54f34176:

    # e "I can't just leave Aine and Gwen to fend for themselves. I am the reason why they are here in the first place."
    e "我没法抛弃艾妮和格温。毕竟是我把她俩带来这里的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:65
translate chinese emmasoloending_d2b7a74f:

    # e "How will the others adjust if we're not around?"
    e "我们不在之后，其他人要怎么办？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:66
translate chinese emmasoloending_e6a638f2:

    # e "I'm not sure if it's worth it..."
    e "我不知道这么做到底值不值得……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:67
translate chinese emmasoloending_ffe79941:

    # mc "Why don't you go and talk to Aine? We can't be sure until we try. Right now, all I want is your resolve and trust. Leave everything else to me."
    mc "你去和艾妮谈谈如何？不去尝试一下怎么知道呢。现在，我只需要你的决心和信任。把其他的都交给我吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:68
translate chinese emmasoloending_665c1394:

    # mc "That said, I'm sure it will be worth it. We'll just have to persevere one more time."
    mc "只要有你，我很确定一切都是值得的。我们只需要再坚持一次就好。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:71
translate chinese emmasoloending_52674ebf:

    # e "... One more time."
    e "……再坚持一次。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:72
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_2:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:75
translate chinese emmasoloending_2302acd8:

    # e "I'll talk to her. She's still my best friend – I can't leave her without any heads up."
    e "我会去找艾妮谈的。她依然是我最好的朋友，我不能一声不吭就离开她。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:76
translate chinese emmasoloending_8c1c823a:

    # mc "Yeah, you do that, and I'll handle the rest."
    mc "好，你去吧，其他的我来搞定。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:77
translate chinese emmasoloending_91ad3b94:

    # mc "After that, I want you to pack your stuff. I will send you an address. Wait for me there."
    mc "谈完之后，你就收拾东西，我之后发给你一个地址，你去那里等我。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:78
translate chinese emmasoloending_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:93
translate chinese emmasoloending_669664cb:

    # mc "Hey."
    mc "嘿。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:96
translate chinese emmasoloending_7c4523c9:

    # g "So, why call me out here? I've been waiting for you in my room. I was expecting you to come."
    g "为什么把我叫出来？我一直在房间里等你呢。还以为你会过去。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:97
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:98
translate chinese emmasoloending_31c1bda8:

    # g "What's with that face?"
    g "怎么这种表情？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:101
translate chinese emmasoloending_e44a3760:

    # mc "I need to talk to you before I go..."
    mc "我走之前有话要跟你说……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:102
translate chinese emmasoloending_3f26d5f8:

    # g "Before... you go?"
    g "走……之前？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:103
translate chinese emmasoloending_ec8dcdeb:

    # g "[mc], what's going on..."
    g "[mc!t]，怎么了……？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:106
translate chinese emmasoloending_5547ec87:

    # mc "You know I've never, ever lied to you before. So, I'll be honest and get straight to the point."
    mc "你也知道我从来、从来没对你说过谎。所以，我就开门见山地直说了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:109
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:112
translate chinese emmasoloending_507a9bdf:

    # mc "Gwen... Emma and I are leaving. For good..."
    mc "格温……我和艾玛要走了。不回来了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:113
translate chinese emmasoloending_4986f2c1:

    # mc "Even now, I know I'm a jerk to leave just like that. But I'm not an asshole, so I will also talk to your father about this."
    mc "哪怕到了现在，我也知道我这么一走了之，真不是个东西。但我也不是个完全的人渣。所以，这件事我也会告诉你爸爸的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:114
translate chinese emmasoloending_42d4d982:

    # mc "... I'm really sorry."
    mc "……我真的很抱歉。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:117
translate chinese emmasoloending_ceeb6b2e:

    # g "Yeah... So, this is it, huh?"
    g "好啊……还是来了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:118
translate chinese emmasoloending_96dba21d:

    # g "Honestly, I already saw this coming after what Emma told me, but..."
    g "说实话，艾玛把事情告诉我之后，我就已经想到会有这么一出了，但是……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:119
translate chinese emmasoloending_6674439b:

    # g "Shit... I never thought it would hurt this much..."
    g "操……我都不知道会有这么难受……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:120
translate chinese emmasoloending_e9cb2c16:

    # mc "Are you... crying?"
    mc "你……哭了吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:121
translate chinese emmasoloending_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:122
translate chinese emmasoloending_ff4eceec:

    # g "It's not me who's crying. It's my eyes..."
    g "我没有哭。只是我的眼睛在流泪……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:125
translate chinese emmasoloending_a15152f5:

    # mc "Gwen, listen-"
    mc "格温，听我——"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:126
translate chinese emmasoloending_3aba5658:

    # g "-No need to explain, [mc]. I already know..."
    g "不用解释了，[mc!t]。我已经明白了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:127
translate chinese emmasoloending_3a4de7dd:

    # g "I knew all of the short time we were together. You proved that you loved me..."
    g "在我们在一起的这短暂的时间里，我已经看出来，你也证明了，你是爱我的……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:130
translate chinese emmasoloending_7968adcb:

    # g "It's just that... why do you have to be so unfair?"
    g "只是……为什么你这么偏心？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:131
translate chinese emmasoloending_6b6c0280:

    # g "Why do you have to leave me at a time like this?"
    g "为什么你要在这种时候离开我？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:132
translate chinese emmasoloending_6a176908:

    # g "Why do you have to leave me when I already made so many plans for the both of us?"
    g "我已经给咱们两个想好了将来，你却要离开我？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:133
translate chinese emmasoloending_652c4b56:

    # g "I haven't even introduced you to my mother yet."
    g "我甚至还没把你介绍给我妈妈……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:134
translate chinese emmasoloending_bfe15e81:

    # g "I'm not all that vocal when it comes to my feelings, but... I've... already thought out so, so much..."
    g "情感方面，我向来不会说太多，但是……我……已经想了非常、非常多……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:135
translate chinese emmasoloending_c862b4c7:

    # yt "That's right, she's not the most emotionally expressive person."
    yt "是的，在感情方面，她不会表达出来太多。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:136
translate chinese emmasoloending_51248436:

    # yt "She would usually shrug it off and joke around. That's the trait that makes her so strong."
    yt "她一般只会耸耸肩，一笑了之。就是这样她才很坚强。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:137
translate chinese emmasoloending_ee73bbd5:

    # yt "So, for her to be reduced to tears like this... I can't imagine the pain she's feeling."
    yt "连那样的她都开始流泪……我无法想象她此时有多痛苦。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:138
translate chinese emmasoloending_35e94589:

    # yt "But I've already made my choice, and there is no turning back now."
    yt "但我已经做出了决定，现在没有办法回头了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:139
translate chinese emmasoloending_4cbd04b1:

    # mc "Life has never been fair to any of us, Gwen. But whether we accept the unjust is up to us to decide. Otherwise, we can never push through."
    mc "生活对每个人都不公平，格温。但我们自己可以决定要不要接受这种不公。不然的话，我们永远没法前进的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:140
translate chinese emmasoloending_ae01e29f:

    # mc "This might be too hypocritical of me to say at this point, but I've never seen you once in this state. It hurts me to see you like this."
    mc "现在我说这种话可能太虚伪了，但我从来没见过你这种样子，所以我内心也很受伤。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:141
translate chinese emmasoloending_f8b05a34:

    # mc "But I've confidently, perhaps recklessly, chosen this pain. To make things right..."
    mc "但我已经充满信心地，可能还是过于莽撞地，选择了这种痛苦，好让我可以改正错误……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:142
translate chinese emmasoloending_4b340443_1:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:145
translate chinese emmasoloending_ccadb820:

    # g "Before you go, let me ask you one thing."
    g "你走之前，我再问你一件事。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:146
translate chinese emmasoloending_af353eb6:

    # mc "Go ahead."
    mc "问吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:147
translate chinese emmasoloending_766c6115:

    # g "If we were to meet in a world where Emma and Aine didn't exist, would you still love me then?"
    g "如果我们是在没有艾妮和艾玛的世界认识的，你还会爱我吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:148
translate chinese emmasoloending_0919d368:

    # mc "Yes, without a doubt."
    mc "当然会。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:149
translate chinese emmasoloending_823a81e8:

    # mc "You never judged me for who I was. You always picked me up whenever I was down."
    mc "你从来都不在意我的身份。你在我难过的时候总会鼓励我。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:150
translate chinese emmasoloending_70b1f562:

    # mc "And I would still drink that wine you offered me, even knowing how bad it tastes."
    mc "而且，哪怕已经知道味道很难喝了，我也依然会喝那天你给我的酒。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:151
translate chinese emmasoloending_986df748:

    # g "*chuckles* Damn you."
    g "*轻笑* 你啊……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:154
translate chinese emmasoloending_714946a1:

    # g "*hugs tightly*"
    g "*抱紧*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:155
translate chinese emmasoloending_d5562051:

    # g "Go, but never say goodbye..."
    g "走吧，但这不是永别……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:156
translate chinese emmasoloending_921a26ed:

    # g "Emma is still my friend, and I know we will one day meet again."
    g "艾玛依然是我的朋友，我知道我们总有一天会再见的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:157
translate chinese emmasoloending_37971af5:

    # g "Don't forget about me, [mc]..."
    g "不要忘了我，[mc!t]……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:160
translate chinese emmasoloending_674270ca:

    # mc "Argh!"
    mc "我……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:163
translate chinese emmasoloending_9f9abbc5:

    # mc "I won't, I promise!"
    mc "我不会的！我保证！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:164
translate chinese emmasoloending_432ad1d7:

    # g "Now, turn around slowly, and don't show me your face. It will... just hurt more."
    g "慢慢转过去吧，别让我看见你的脸。只会让我……更受伤。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:179
translate chinese emmasoloending_9dc4f142:

    # g "See you next time, [mc]..."
    g "有缘再见了，[mc!t]……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:180
translate chinese emmasoloending_1ebce7b9:

    # mc "*hics*"
    mc "*抽泣*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:181
translate chinese emmasoloending_f1eab10a:

    # mc "Yeah... until next time..."
    mc "是啊……再见了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:198
translate chinese emmasoloending_0f1e7100:

    # g "One stick won't hurt..."
    g "来一根也没什么大不了的……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:199
translate chinese emmasoloending_cd4f0f40:

    # g "Right, [mc]?"
    g "对吧，[mc!t]？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:202
translate chinese emmasoloending_4b340443_2:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:205
translate chinese emmasoloending_1f975aea:

    # g "*whimpers*"
    g "*呜咽*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:208
translate chinese emmasoloending_0e3bc851:

    # g "{i}Goodbye... [mc].{/i}"
    g "{i}再见……[mc!t]。{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:237
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:240
translate chinese emmasoloending_9b70c2bf:

    # un "Did you walk all the way here with that face? Must've been tough, huh?"
    un "你就一路带着这种表情走过来的吗？肯定不好受吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:243
translate chinese emmasoloending_f2316b97:

    # mc "Ah."
    mc "啊。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:244
translate chinese emmasoloending_831ee5ce:

    # yt "Shit, I didn't expect him to be here."
    yt "操，我没想到他会在这。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:245
translate chinese emmasoloending_ad884418:

    # yt "But, this is my chance. I'll settle this here and now."
    yt "但这是我的机会。跟他说清楚吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:248
translate chinese emmasoloending_250d9399:

    # mc "Glenn, we need to talk."
    mc "格伦，我们得谈谈。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:249
translate chinese emmasoloending_29f9d566:

    # gl "Yes, we do indeed."
    gl "是啊，确实得谈谈。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:250
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:253
translate chinese emmasoloending_a3c8ba72:

    # gl "One day over a glass of whisky, when you're telling me your story."
    gl "改天一边喝威士忌，一边把你的故事告诉我吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:254
translate chinese emmasoloending_334b3094:

    # mc "H-huh?"
    mc "啊？什么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:257
translate chinese emmasoloending_e5611a63:

    # gl "Save those words for later. What I heard from the young lass was more than enough."
    gl "心里的话就先放着吧。我从姑娘那里听到的就已经够多了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:258
translate chinese emmasoloending_26d83765:

    # gl "That lingering pain from your expression already told me what I needed to know."
    gl "看你的表情那么痛苦，我也就明白了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:262
translate chinese emmasoloending_b8d6e330:

    # gl "*chuckles* You know, I wasn't expecting you to ask me back then. Did you think it was the \"perfect opportunity\"?"
    gl "*轻笑* 知道吗，之前那一次，我都没想到你会那样问我。你觉得那是最合适的机会吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:263
translate chinese emmasoloending_7c8da23a:

    # mc "Yes. I thought the mood was right, and I didn't know if I'd still have a chance if I let it slip through my fingers."
    mc "是的。我认为气氛到位了，而且如果错过的话，可能就再也没有机会了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:272
translate chinese emmasoloending_75fb78b5:

    # gl "Ahh, I thought as much."
    gl "啊，跟我想的一样。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:273
translate chinese emmasoloending_b4f537b5:

    # gl "And what would you have done if I did not agree?"
    gl "那我如果没有同意，你要怎么办？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:274
translate chinese emmasoloending_9f8c0aa9:

    # mc "I'd have never stopped asking. Even if you pointed that gun at my head, I'd negotiate with my life on the line if I had to."
    mc "我就一直求你同意。哪怕你用枪指着我的头，我也要把命赌上，继续求你。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:275
translate chinese emmasoloending_d7e4c595:

    # gl "How did you..."
    gl "你是怎么……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:276
translate chinese emmasoloending_67d1c4de:

    # mc "I barely picked it up, but I heard Gwen whisper when she hugged you."
    mc "当时格温抱你的时候，尽管声音很小，我还是听见她低声说的话了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:277
translate chinese emmasoloending_de7f2028:

    # gl "I see..."
    gl "我懂了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:278
translate chinese emmasoloending_256d2c95:

    # gl "You're a better man than I am, [mc]."
    gl "你是个比我还好的男人，[mc!t]。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:279
translate chinese emmasoloending_6782a48f:

    # gl "Unfortunately, you and Gwen will never end up together. I like you, and how you think, you know?"
    gl "你和格温没法走到最后了，这很遗憾。我喜欢你，也喜欢你思考的方式。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:282
translate chinese emmasoloending_d1b60494:

    # mc "Your daughter-"
    mc "你的女儿——"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:283
translate chinese emmasoloending_524dbefe:

    # mc "No – Gwen – is the strongest woman I've ever known! She's a big reason for who I became!"
    mc "不，格温是我见过最坚强的女性！我能是现在这个样子，很大一部分也都是多亏了她！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:284
translate chinese emmasoloending_140ad8bd:

    # mc "Wherever my life leads me, she will always be a part of me!"
    mc "不管以后我的生活如何，她都一直会是我的一部分！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:285
translate chinese emmasoloending_853511bb:

    # mc "So, I apologize for becoming a reason of your disappointment!"
    mc "所以我真的很抱歉，我让你们失望了！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:288
translate chinese emmasoloending_8dc1cb76:

    # gl "*inhales deeply*"
    gl "*深吸一口气*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:289
translate chinese emmasoloending_849e71ea:

    # gl "..."
    gl "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:292
translate chinese emmasoloending_c5dbd972:

    # gl "Do you know how often I've heard those words being said in my office?"
    gl "你知道刚刚那些话，我在我的办公室里听过几次吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:293
translate chinese emmasoloending_e0f3a6fe:

    # mc "No, sir... I do not..."
    mc "不，先生……我不知道……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:294
translate chinese emmasoloending_70767aa3:

    # gl "Never."
    gl "一次也没听到过。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:295
translate chinese emmasoloending_c1dff962:

    # mc "Oh..."
    mc "噢……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:298
translate chinese emmasoloending_59676515:

    # gl "Come on, pick your head back up."
    gl "好了，把头抬起来吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:299
translate chinese emmasoloending_12cdcd06:

    # gl "You made a choice – now face it with your head up high. Good luck."
    gl "你做出了选择；那就抬头挺胸地去面对吧。祝你好运。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:300
translate chinese emmasoloending_4167684b:

    # mc "T-thank you!"
    mc "谢-谢谢你！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:304
translate chinese emmasoloending_6515c649:

    # gl "Go on now, the girls are waiting for you."
    gl "走吧，姑娘们还在等你呢。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:305
translate chinese emmasoloending_bc8ce9c0:

    # gl "Oh, I don't know if working in a construction company fancies you, but if you want a job – come and find me."
    gl "噢，还有，不知道你对在建筑公司上班感不感兴趣，不过假如你想找工作的话，来找我就行了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:306
translate chinese emmasoloending_6d4279c9:

    # gl "I'll have that glass of whisky ready for you."
    gl "我会给你准备好那杯威士忌的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:325
translate chinese emmasoloending_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:328
translate chinese emmasoloending_052fd87c:

    # k "I guess I don't have to ask anymore. You two already made up your mind."
    k "看来我不用再问了。你们两个已经下定决心了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:329
translate chinese emmasoloending_851d19de:

    # k "Do you have a place to stay?"
    k "你们有地方住吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:330
translate chinese emmasoloending_5178b796:

    # mc "No, but we'll find somewhere we can stay for the time being."
    mc "还没有，但我们会尽快找到一个能暂时住下的地方的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:331
translate chinese emmasoloending_05ac8ecf:

    # k "*sighs*"
    k "*叹气*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:334
translate chinese emmasoloending_14c955d3:

    # k "Well then, take this."
    k "那就拿上这个吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:335
translate chinese emmasoloending_daa752da:

    # mc "A key?"
    mc "钥匙？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:336
translate chinese emmasoloending_d57f8add:

    # k "A key to the house where I used to stay... alone. Back in my younger days."
    k "这是我之前住的一个房子的钥匙……就我自己。在我年轻的时候。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:339
translate chinese emmasoloending_f7627240:

    # k "Just do me a favor and don't ask about it. It is something that I don't want to remember any longer."
    k "就当帮我个忙，不要问太多。那些事我已经不想再回忆了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:340
translate chinese emmasoloending_77afd32e:

    # mc "O-okay..."
    mc "好-好吧……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:341
translate chinese emmasoloending_246c94dc:

    # k "The place is a bit run-down, but it will provide you peace."
    k "那里有点破了，但能让你们住得很宁静。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:342
translate chinese emmasoloending_f7e9e23d:

    # k "Don't worry, I will not bother you. Just remember that there will still be a place you called {i}home{/i}, waiting for you to come back."
    k "不用担心，我不会去打扰你们的。只是要记住，你依然还有另一个{i}家{/i}，在等着你回来。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:343
translate chinese emmasoloending_1365b3ac:

    # mc "I will. Thanks, [landlady]..."
    mc "我会的。谢谢，[landlady!t]……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:346
translate chinese emmasoloending_dd4e262f:

    # j "So? What about your job?"
    j "所以？你的工作怎么办？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:347
translate chinese emmasoloending_8534529c:

    # mc "Well, I'd like to keep it, if that's okay. Although I know the time will come when I must leave it behind, too."
    mc "嗯，可以的话，我还想继续干。尽管我知道我迟早有一天也会离开那里的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:350
translate chinese emmasoloending_8417041c:

    # j "*chuckles* I get it."
    j "*轻笑* 我明白了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:351
translate chinese emmasoloending_6ac9af14:

    # j "In any case, whatever happens, you know where to find me."
    j "总之，不管发生什么，你知道去哪找我。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:352
translate chinese emmasoloending_3e432a99:

    # j "Take care, and good luck."
    j "保重，祝你们好运。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:355
translate chinese emmasoloending_f9ad0d94:

    # mc "Shall we go?"
    mc "我们走吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:358
translate chinese emmasoloending_94a92282:

    # e "Mhm!"
    e "嗯！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:379
translate chinese emmasoloending_a5c7e38d:

    # yt "It's been three years since then..."
    yt "那之后过了三年……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:380
translate chinese emmasoloending_7e0a902c:

    # yt "We immediately moved into the house that my [landlady] offered."
    yt "我们立马搬进了[landlady!t]给我们的房子里。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:381
translate chinese emmasoloending_92ef20cf:

    # yt "To this day, it remains a mystery where she got it."
    yt "这栋房子到底是哪来的，到了今天也是个谜。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:382
translate chinese emmasoloending_b0e534a8:

    # yt "But it's a place that no one knows, aside from her. So it was challenging for us to start anew with no outside connections."
    yt "但那个地方除了她以外，没有人知道。所以我们两个在无依无靠的情况下重新开始也并不容易。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:383
translate chinese emmasoloending_9ac1758d:

    # yt "Despite that, I kept my promise, and we married about three months later."
    yt "此外，我也履行了承诺，我们在大概三个月之后就结婚了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:384
translate chinese emmasoloending_f88731a3:

    # yt "Roughly a year after we left our old lives, I resigned from the burger shack."
    yt "我们开始新生活差不多一年之后，我从汉堡店辞职了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:385
translate chinese emmasoloending_b7cc24da:

    # yt "I felt so empty quitting the job that I loved, as well as leaving the people I called {i}friends{/i}..."
    yt "放弃了我喜爱的工作，离开了那些我称之为{i}朋友{/i}的人，让我感到很空虚……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:386
translate chinese emmasoloending_980c8c40:

    # yt "But, I thought I could explore my childhood hobby, and became a freelance photographer."
    yt "但是，我也重新捡起了我童年时的爱好，开始了自由摄影师的生涯。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:387
translate chinese emmasoloending_5af6b990:

    # yt "I was hesitant to do so at first, but honestly, I once again found my passion in photography. It was something that I did not expect."
    yt "一开始我有些犹豫，但实话实说，我重新对摄影燃起了热情。这一点是我没有想到的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:388
translate chinese emmasoloending_57b9a553:

    # yt "Also, I had this curiosity about Emma's line of work that eventually bloomed into an interest. So, she recruited me to her Private Investigations Agency as her sidekick."
    yt "我还对艾玛的工作产生了浓厚的兴趣，所以她也让我作为助手加入了她所在的私人侦探事务所。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:389
translate chinese emmasoloending_ba098456:

    # yt "Yes, my wife and I worked two jobs simultaneously. She continued working as a detective while doing private investigations on the side."
    yt "是的，我和我老婆都是同时在干两份工作。她平常都是警察，偶尔也会做些私家侦探的活儿。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:390
translate chinese emmasoloending_4081c708:

    # yt "I initially thought I wouldn't be able to handle two jobs, but boy... it was fun! A husband and wife detective duo, how about that?"
    yt "我本来以为我没法应付两份工作，但是……可真有意思！夫妻侦探二人组，可够酷的吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:391
translate chinese emmasoloending_c15a3889:

    # yt "Although, we've faced some hurdles as we tried to live independently."
    yt "尽管，我们一起生活的时候也遇到过不少困难。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:392
translate chinese emmasoloending_7cbe011f:

    # yt "Emma hadn't had a new case for weeks while I struggled to find new clients."
    yt "艾玛已经几个月没有新案子了，我也很难找到新的客户。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:393
translate chinese emmasoloending_f0ea64f1:

    # yt "The past few months were tough, and we've considered finding a new line of work."
    yt "过去的几个月很困难，而且我们也在考虑，想换新的工作。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:394
translate chinese emmasoloending_258addf1:

    # yt "That was until... something unexpected happened..."
    yt "直到……发生了一件未曾预料过的事……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:398
translate chinese emmasoloending_d8730a5a:

    # yt "{i}Spring, 20th of March..."
    yt "{i}三月的第二十天，春……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:409
translate chinese emmasoloending_2977c0c3:

    # un "{i}A doll came walking towards me.{/i}"
    un "{i}一个娃娃正朝我走来。{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:412
translate chinese emmasoloending_3cd4dfbb:

    # un "{i}She never smiled...{/i}"
    un "{i}她不会笑……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:413
translate chinese emmasoloending_bc6f8952:

    # un "{i}She never talked...{/i}"
    un "{i}她不会说话……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:416
translate chinese emmasoloending_0221f952:

    # un "{i}All she did, was greet me and look at my old plushies.{/i}"
    un "{i}只是跟我打了个招呼，还看了看我的旧毛绒玩具。{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:423
translate chinese emmasoloending_e4fbe5b8:

    # un "{i}She paused for a second, then entered our house.{/i}"
    un "{i}她稍微停了一下，就走进了我家。{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:426
translate chinese emmasoloending_ae2354c4:

    # un "{i}She looked like terrible news, but she's extremely cool! I wonder if she'd willing to play with me...{/i}"
    un "{i}她看着像是带来了很糟糕的消息一样，但是她也特别特别酷！不知道她愿不愿意陪我玩……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:463
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_3:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:465
translate chinese emmasoloending_fcc6ee53:

    # nad "... Officer Meyer?"
    nad "……梅耶警官？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:466
translate chinese emmasoloending_46a0012c:

    # e "Ah, I'm sorry."
    e "啊，不好意思。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:469
translate chinese emmasoloending_472d9ea5:

    # nad "Please, take a seat."
    nad "请坐吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:470
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_4:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:471
translate chinese emmasoloending_421bf061:

    # e "{i}She looks... pale."
    e "{i}她……好苍白。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:474
translate chinese emmasoloending_f4ef781d:

    # nad "Can I offer you anything?"
    nad "要喝点什么吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:475
translate chinese emmasoloending_17e43748:

    # e "Please, don't bother."
    e "不用了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:478
translate chinese emmasoloending_4c5841cb:

    # un "*whispers* Hmn... What are they talking about? This is the first time mom had any visitors..."
    un "*低语* 嗯……她们在说什么呢？这是第一次有客人来找妈妈……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:481
translate chinese emmasoloending_40d55f5e:

    # un "*whispers* Could she be a relative? My auntie, perhaps? She doesn't look like mom, though..."
    un "*低语* 她会是亲戚吗？可能是我的小姨？但她跟妈妈长得不像……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:482
translate chinese emmasoloending_83edb716:

    # un "*whispers* But all relatives already abandoned us... Then, who is she?"
    un "*低语* 而且我们所有的亲戚都已经不管我们了……那她会是谁呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:485
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_5:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:488
translate chinese emmasoloending_82b8a088:

    # un "Ah!"
    un "啊！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:491
translate chinese emmasoloending_02f7a362:

    # e "{i}*chuckles*{/i}"
    e "{i}*轻笑*{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:494
translate chinese emmasoloending_c9dda023:

    # nad "We can hear you, Leah! Where are your manners?"
    nad "我们都听见你了，莉娅！怎么这么没礼貌？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:495
translate chinese emmasoloending_3f060f86:

    # nad "Come and say \"good morning\"!"
    nad "快过来说“早上好”！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:498
translate chinese emmasoloending_2a327a61:

    # le "Eek~!"
    le "哎呀~！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:501
translate chinese emmasoloending_0dd075cf:

    # le "Uhm... Good morning."
    le "呃……早上好。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:502
translate chinese emmasoloending_2838f70c:

    # e "Mhm."
    e "嗯。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:505
translate chinese emmasoloending_98741ac3:

    # le "..."
    le "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:506
translate chinese emmasoloending_8d34fbb2:

    # e "...."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:509
translate chinese emmasoloending_f51ab96b:

    # le "Here!"
    le "给！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:510
translate chinese emmasoloending_19e3a5a4:

    # e "I-"
    e "我——"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:511
translate chinese emmasoloending_78052016:

    # le "He's my least favorite, so I'm letting you borrow him for a while! But, you must return him to me later!"
    le "他是我最不喜欢的，所以借给你一会儿！但是，之后必须还给我！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:514
translate chinese emmasoloending_f4531741:

    # e "{i}Her... least favorite? Why?{/i}"
    e "{i}她……最不喜欢的？为什么？{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:521
translate chinese emmasoloending_8a0151f2:

    # e "*sighs*"
    e "*叹气*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:524
translate chinese emmasoloending_c2154c33:

    # nad "You're not a socialite, are you?"
    nad "看来你不太擅长交际啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:525
translate chinese emmasoloending_0b43fb75:

    # e "Well, it helps from time to time."
    e "其实，这样有时候反而会帮上忙。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:526
translate chinese emmasoloending_c3df74e1:

    # nad "I have no idea how you do it, but I'll leave it at that."
    nad "我听不懂你这到底是什么意思，但是我也不多问了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:529
translate chinese emmasoloending_07a93a5f:

    # e "How old is she?"
    e "她多大了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:530
translate chinese emmasoloending_adc84b9d:

    # nad "She's turning ten this year..."
    nad "很快就要十岁了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:531
translate chinese emmasoloending_4b30d2df:

    # e "{i}So, a few years older than me when I was here...{/i}"
    e "{i}那，比我住在这里的时候要大几岁……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:532
translate chinese emmasoloending_1eb0df34:

    # nad "She's a bit stubborn, yet a kind and sweet little girl."
    nad "她有点犟，但还是个很可爱很善良的小姑娘。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:535
translate chinese emmasoloending_16f61cde:

    # nad "It pains me that I can't take care of her as much as I did when she was younger."
    nad "我没法像她小时候那样照顾她了，我很难受。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:539
translate chinese emmasoloending_34eda977:

    # e "Why is that?"
    e "此话怎讲？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:543
translate chinese emmasoloending_db7e3ab7:

    # nad "I'm at my wit's end, officer Meyer. All I can think about is him and the possibility that..."
    nad "我快要疯了，梅耶警官。我脑子里只有他，还有他可能……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:544
translate chinese emmasoloending_53ad39ca:

    # nad "*sobs*"
    nad "*抽泣*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:545
translate chinese emmasoloending_8cc48767:

    # nad "I don't know what to do anymore. If I lose him, my... I mean, {i}our{/i} future is lost..."
    nad "我不知道要怎么办了。要是我失去他，我的……不，我是说，{i}我们{/i}的未来也就毁了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:548
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_6:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:551
translate chinese emmasoloending_529bcac7:

    # e "I understand. Please, take a deep breath and tell me what I can do for you."
    e "我明白了。请你深呼吸一下，告诉我，我能为你做些什么。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:564
translate chinese emmasoloending_b7dc0642:

    # le "Hmm? You don't think the doll will come?"
    le "嗯？你觉得娃娃不会来吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:565
translate chinese emmasoloending_4a55034f:

    # le "Trust me, she will! I let her borrow Mr. Penguin, so she must return him!"
    le "相信我，她会的！我把企鹅先生借给她了，所以她一定得还给我！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:568
translate chinese emmasoloending_1d4403d9:

    # le "You still don't think so?"
    le "你还是不信？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:569
translate chinese emmasoloending_6f7e03ea:

    # le "You don't trust Mr. Penguin? Come on, now... Why would you hate him?"
    le "你不相信企鹅先生？别嘛……你为什么不喜欢他？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:571
translate chinese emmasoloending_774e4b54:

    # "*knocks*"
    "*敲门*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:574
translate chinese emmasoloending_c81ce0a4:

    # le "Mom?"
    le "妈妈？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:575
translate chinese emmasoloending_593631ef:

    # e "No, uhm... It's your \"visitor\"."
    e "不，呃……是你们的“客人”。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:578
translate chinese emmasoloending_7c498041:

    # le "*gasps*"
    le "*惊讶*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:579
translate chinese emmasoloending_a461a6de:

    # le "Come in, come in~!"
    le "请进，请进~！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:583
translate chinese emmasoloending_c3faa3d5:

    # "*door closes*"
    "*关门*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:584
translate chinese emmasoloending_252d1fd8:

    # e "{i}How long has it been, huh? This brings back a lot of memories. I can't believe it still looks the same as it used to back then.{/i}"
    e "{i}已经过了多久了？我想起来了好多过去的事。真不敢相信，这里居然看着还和以前一样。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:587
translate chinese emmasoloending_95e24dd5:

    # le "Welcome~!"
    le "欢迎~！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:590
translate chinese emmasoloending_0663be34:

    # le "See~? What did I tell you, Mr. Fox? I told you the doll would come!"
    le "看吧~？我怎么跟你说的，狐狸先生？我都说了娃娃会来的！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:591
translate chinese emmasoloending_dfd47038:

    # e "\"The doll\"?"
    e "娃娃？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:594
translate chinese emmasoloending_d3320ab4:

    # e "{i}Is this how I used to act? I wonder...{/i}"
    e "{i}我以前也是这样的吗？我很好奇……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:597
translate chinese emmasoloending_94a2c86e:

    # le "Come, come~!"
    le "来吧，来吧~！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:601
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_7:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:604
translate chinese emmasoloending_11b67026:

    # e "Uhm... Miss Leah, I'm sorry, but I'm not a doll."
    e "呃……不好意思，不过我不是个娃娃，莉娅小姐。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:607
translate chinese emmasoloending_b037702d:

    # le "But you are, though! You don't smile. You talk, but you don't change your tone whatsoever!"
    le "但你就是呀！你都不笑的。虽然你会说话，但是声音一点起伏都没有！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:608
translate chinese emmasoloending_f4815773:

    # e "{i}I've already lost count of how many times I've been told that...{/i}"
    e "{i}我被人这么说已经不知道有多少次了……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:611
translate chinese emmasoloending_d2fd9bf4:

    # e "Let me borrow your hand."
    e "把你的手给我。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:614
translate chinese emmasoloending_2de4594f:

    # e "Well?"
    e "怎么样啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:615
translate chinese emmasoloending_9ef8abdf:

    # le "Oh... You're not..."
    le "噢……你真的不是……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:616
translate chinese emmasoloending_b52c0d55:

    # e "I am not, miss Leah."
    e "我不是娃娃，莉娅小姐。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:617
translate chinese emmasoloending_a2490e27:

    # le "You're so pretty when you smile~..."
    le "你笑的时候真漂亮……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:618
translate chinese emmasoloending_b8e5d1b9:

    # e "{i}The innocence of a child can be too much sometimes...{/i}"
    e "{i}小孩的天真有时候真让人受不了……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:619
translate chinese emmasoloending_5f3851d2:

    # e "Thank you. Is this your room?"
    e "谢谢你。这里是你的房间吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:622
translate chinese emmasoloending_f4dad3bd:

    # le "Hmm? Yeah! Who else would it belong to?"
    le "嗯？是啊！不然还能是谁的？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:625
translate chinese emmasoloending_aadb3386:

    # e "{i}Oh, dear... I'm sure she and [mc] would get along well. Her tone of voice and how she speaks reminds me a lot of him for some reason.{/i}"
    e "{i}天啊……她跟[mc!t]肯定关系会很好。这种声音的腔调，还有回答的方式，不知怎么总让我想起他。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:628
translate chinese emmasoloending_50ee8c34:

    # e "{i}Well, just in case...{/i}"
    e "{i}以防万一……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:631
translate chinese emmasoloending_db173efd:

    # le "Hey, since you have Mr. Penguin with you, let's play!"
    le "那个，既然你都拿着企鹅先生了，我们来玩吧！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:632
translate chinese emmasoloending_c8f72d41:

    # e "*chuckles* I knew it."
    e "*轻笑* 我就知道。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:633
translate chinese emmasoloending_46b420d9:

    # e "I apologize, miss Leah, but I must leave for now. Maybe some other time."
    e "对不起，莉娅小姐，但是我必须走了。下次有机会再说吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:636
translate chinese emmasoloending_763b4899:

    # le "Hrmnn... But I let you borrow him, too..."
    le "哼……我都借给你了……！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:637
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_8:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:638
translate chinese emmasoloending_726eabd7:

    # e "Don't worry, I'll be back tomorrow."
    e "没事的，明天我会再来的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:641
translate chinese emmasoloending_fa3c8f66:

    # le "Really~?"
    le "真的吗~？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:644
translate chinese emmasoloending_2838f70c_1:

    # e "Mhm."
    e "嗯。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:645
translate chinese emmasoloending_d0cadeca:

    # e "I'm returning him to you for now. Always take care of them for me, alright?"
    e "我把他先还给你。一定要替我照顾好他们，行吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:646
translate chinese emmasoloending_3f8fadb6:

    # le "O-okay...?"
    le "好-好吧……？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:652
translate chinese emmasoloending_d446c425:

    # e "Take a look under your bed. I drew some things on the floor when I was four."
    e "仔细看一下你的床底下。我四岁的时候在地板上画过一些东西。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:656
translate chinese emmasoloending_c3faa3d5_1:

    # "*door closes*"
    "*关门*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:657
translate chinese emmasoloending_b1bc63c7:

    # le "Hmm?"
    le "嗯？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:660
translate chinese emmasoloending_e4bd4b2a:

    # le "Ah!"
    le "啊！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:663
translate chinese emmasoloending_c3faa3d5_2:

    # "*door closes*"
    "*关门*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:664
translate chinese emmasoloending_ac3ec3dd:

    # le "Mom, where is she?"
    le "妈妈，她去哪了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:667
translate chinese emmasoloending_fafa503a:

    # nad "She left just now. Why?"
    nad "她刚走，怎么了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:668
translate chinese emmasoloending_309bc00a:

    # le "That extremely cool woman used to live here!"
    le "那个超酷的女人以前也住在这里！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:669
translate chinese emmasoloending_0bc53b6d:

    # nad "What?!"
    nad "什么？！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:672
translate chinese emmasoloending_311ad921:

    # le "Does that mean... {i}you guys{/i}..."
    le "难道说……{i}你们两个{/i}……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:675
translate chinese emmasoloending_d34b22f6:

    # le "Whoa..."
    le "哇……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:686
translate chinese emmasoloending_d7bf05f9:

    # e "Hmm?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:689
translate chinese emmasoloending_f0052b52:

    # e "[mc]~!"
    e "[mc!t]~！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:690
translate chinese emmasoloending_e7203418:

    # mc "Oh hey, Em!"
    mc "小艾！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:702
translate chinese emmasoloending_ac296cfa:

    # mc "So, it's done, I assume?"
    mc "看来是搞定了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:703
translate chinese emmasoloending_e3df04b4:

    # e "No, I still have to go back tomorrow. How about you? Any luck?"
    e "不，我明天还要再回去一次。你呢？成了吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:704
translate chinese emmasoloending_4d3eea0a:

    # mc "Gah! Still nothing. But I will be on standby for the next two days."
    mc "唉！还是没有。但我接下来两天要待命了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:705
translate chinese emmasoloending_1f1631d7:

    # mc "There was this couple that asked for my rates. They seemed interested and said they'll get back to me in two to three days."
    mc "有一对情侣问了怎么收费，似乎是感兴趣。他们说过两三天再来联系我。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:706
translate chinese emmasoloending_34f3d931:

    # e "At least that's something, right?"
    e "至少也算有收获，对吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:707
translate chinese emmasoloending_3f871f46:

    # mc "Hmm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:710
translate chinese emmasoloending_c18eb48e:

    # e "W-what?"
    e "怎-怎么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:711
translate chinese emmasoloending_4a6b57dc:

    # mc "Aren't you gonna tell me about your old home sweet home, hmm?"
    mc "你不打算跟我说说你的甜蜜老家怎么样了吗，嗯？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:714
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_9:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:717
translate chinese emmasoloending_4567987b:

    # mc "Come on~! Tell me! How was it?"
    mc "来嘛~！告诉我！怎么样？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:720
translate chinese emmasoloending_6c132931:

    # e "*sighs* Alright, but let's get inside first. I want to sit down."
    e "*叹气* 好吧，但我们先进去吧。我想坐下。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:730
translate chinese emmasoloending_2c7254b7:

    # mc "Is this what you call \"sitting down\"?"
    mc "这就是你所谓的坐下？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:731
translate chinese emmasoloending_547c402a:

    # e "*giggles* Is \"missing you\" enough of reason?"
    e "*笑* 我想你的时候就是这么坐的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:732
translate chinese emmasoloending_38d2c46b:

    # mc "Oh, boy... What will you do without me?"
    mc "瞧瞧……没了我，你还怎么活啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:735
translate chinese emmasoloending_811e7310:

    # e "Hey, don't say that! I'm already exhausted after what I saw earlier!"
    e "别这么说嘛！我今天看见那些之后，已经累坏了！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:736
translate chinese emmasoloending_b69a86be:

    # mc "Well? Tell me how it went!"
    mc "跟我说说具体情况！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:745
translate chinese emmasoloending_004332a0:

    # e "Ahh..."
    e "啊……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:746
translate chinese emmasoloending_15d148e9:

    # e "Honestly, I wasn't ready to return to that place. But, as soon as I entered, it felt like I had left only yesterday. It reminded me of all my memories when I was there."
    e "说实话，我还没准备好回那个地方去。但我刚一进去，就感觉似乎我昨天才离开一样。让我想起了所有我还在那里的时候的事。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:747
translate chinese emmasoloending_ea3eb440:

    # e "You, mom, Hera, and even Aine..."
    e "你，妈妈，赫拉，甚至还有艾妮……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:748
translate chinese emmasoloending_ece54d5d:

    # e "I was quiet the whole time, but it still felt so surreal..."
    e "我一直都很安静，但一切都感觉太不真实了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:749
translate chinese emmasoloending_cabfa4f4:

    # mc "You are always quiet, except when you're with me!"
    mc "你只要不跟我在一起，就一直很安静！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:750
translate chinese emmasoloending_ad238e03:

    # e "I guess..."
    e "可能吧……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:759
translate chinese emmasoloending_ec360e3b:

    # e "But do you know what surprised me the most?"
    e "但你知道最让我惊讶的是什么吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:760
translate chinese emmasoloending_28e8fb65:

    # mc "Uhh... There was a guy that's more handsome than me?"
    mc "呃……那里有个比我还帅的男的？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:761
translate chinese emmasoloending_692b58c3:

    # e "Something like that, yes. *giggles*"
    e "对，可以这么说。*笑*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:762
translate chinese emmasoloending_7b4b2ccf:

    # mc "Ouch..."
    mc "过分……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:763
translate chinese emmasoloending_bfcfc809:

    # e "I mean, there was a little girl that thoroughly reminded me of you."
    e "其实是个小女孩，让我一下子就想起了你。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:764
translate chinese emmasoloending_b4993197:

    # mc "That much, huh?"
    mc "那么像吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:765
translate chinese emmasoloending_91431f15:

    # e "Yeah, she speaks a lot like you did when we were kids. You both have this stupid way of reasoning whenever I ask you something serious."
    e "是啊，她说起话来跟小时候的你特别像。你们俩都是在我问严肃的问题的时候爱乱想。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:766
translate chinese emmasoloending_eb43cf40:

    # e "I was holding back my laughter the entire time I talked to her."
    e "跟她说话的时候，我一直都在憋笑。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:767
translate chinese emmasoloending_fd18cb22:

    # mc "You didn't even crack a smile?"
    mc "连微笑都没有吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:768
translate chinese emmasoloending_879634cc:

    # e "No."
    e "没有。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:769
translate chinese emmasoloending_963962c0:

    # mc "Oh, Em... What have I done to you?"
    mc "噢，小艾……我怎么害你变成了这样？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:770
translate chinese emmasoloending_e17282d4:

    # e "*giggles* I was forcing myself not to laugh, but it wasn't a bad thing. You know how I work."
    e "*笑* 我是在逼着自己不笑，不过这也不是坏事。你也知道我工作时候的样子。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:771
translate chinese emmasoloending_8bf58df2:

    # mc "Yeah, yeah, {i}Emma Stone-Heart{/i}..."
    mc "是啊，铁石心肠的艾玛……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:772
translate chinese emmasoloending_ea6e2548:

    # e "Not only that, everything still looks the same as before."
    e "不仅如此，一切看起来都和以前一样。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:773
translate chinese emmasoloending_c3093419:

    # mc "For real? Like, nothing got changed at all?"
    mc "真的吗？什么都没变？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:774
translate chinese emmasoloending_b5d75902:

    # e "Nothing. Even the plushies I used to play with are still in there."
    e "是的。甚至连我以前的毛绒玩具都还在。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:775
translate chinese emmasoloending_198bcd92:

    # mc "I assume that the kid has them?"
    mc "我猜它们现在归小朋友了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:776
translate chinese emmasoloending_1ad5b5d9:

    # e "Yeah, and it seems she's been taking care of them. It was so strange to see them once again after such a long, long time..."
    e "是啊，看起来她把它们照顾得挺好的。在过了这么、这么久以后，居然又看到了它们，实在是种很奇怪的感觉……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:777
translate chinese emmasoloending_3dd696a2:

    # e "It was so heartwarming, and yet... sad at the same time... I don't know how to describe it."
    e "这感觉很暖心，同时又……有些哀伤……我不知道该怎么描述。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:778
translate chinese emmasoloending_8d82b516:

    # mc "What's her name?"
    mc "她叫什么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:779
translate chinese emmasoloending_a925d4eb:

    # e "Leah."
    e "莉娅。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:780
translate chinese emmasoloending_56433f46:

    # mc "Emma... Leah..."
    mc "艾玛……莉娅……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:781
translate chinese emmasoloending_f46b669d:

    # mc "*chuckles*"
    mc "*轻笑*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:790
translate chinese emmasoloending_77c0ac5e:

    # e "Hmm? What was that chuckle for?"
    e "嗯？你笑什么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:791
translate chinese emmasoloending_5fa5d961:

    # mc "Nothing, it just has a nice ring to it."
    mc "没事，就是说起来挺顺口的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:792
translate chinese emmasoloending_972fb602:

    # e "*sighs* You and your imagination."
    e "你啊，就爱乱想。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:795
translate chinese emmasoloending_965b2ed1:

    # e "Let's prepare dinner. We got an initial investigation to do."
    e "去做晚饭吧。我们该进行初步的调查了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:796
translate chinese emmasoloending_20516a81:

    # mc "Are you taking me on this one?"
    mc "这次你要带我一起吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:797
translate chinese emmasoloending_31313590:

    # e "Yes, I need your expertise this time."
    e "是的，这次用得上你的本事。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:798
translate chinese emmasoloending_6302ebf8:

    # mc "Oho hoooo~! Here we go!"
    mc "哦吼吼吼~！开工咯！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:809
translate chinese emmasoloending_5693a819:

    # mc "Huh..."
    mc "这……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:810
translate chinese emmasoloending_007f29d4:

    # mc "Now {i}that's{/i}... interesting..."
    mc "还挺有意思的……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:811
translate chinese emmasoloending_e955bf51:

    # e "Mhm..."
    e "嗯……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:814
translate chinese emmasoloending_5ecbc00e:

    # mc "Do you think the kid knows?"
    mc "你觉得小朋友知道吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:815
translate chinese emmasoloending_c941de4c:

    # e "I'm not sure, but I doubt it. I didn't have it in me to ask Leah earlier. Thus, I decided to do a background check."
    e "不好说，但应该不知道。我之前没敢问莉娅。所以，我决定做一下背景调查。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:816
translate chinese emmasoloending_dbd15454:

    # e "I knew there was something that she wasn't telling me."
    e "我就知道她有事瞒着我。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:817
translate chinese emmasoloending_4e43a32e:

    # e "Just before she told me to investigate her husband..."
    e "在她让我调查她丈夫之前……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:820
translate chinese emmasoloending_8cc48767_1:

    # nad "I don't know what to do anymore. If I lose him, my... I mean, {i}our{/i} future is lost..."
    nad "我不知道要怎么办了。要是我失去他，我的……不，我是说，{i}我们的{/i}未来也就毁了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:823
translate chinese emmasoloending_bb82cdeb:

    # e "She said, {i}my{/i} and corrected herself."
    e "她先说了“{i}我的{/i}”，之后才又改口。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:824
translate chinese emmasoloending_127046fa:

    # mc "{i}Her{/i} future, and not {i}their{/i} future. Damn, this could get ugly, Em."
    mc "“{i}她的{/i}”未来，而不是“{i}她们的{/i}”未来。我去，事情最后可能不好收场啊，小艾。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:825
translate chinese emmasoloending_c00a786e:

    # e "I know, but we can't base it on speculations alone-"
    e "我知道，但我们也不能光凭猜测——"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:829
translate chinese emmasoloending_efc68e9f:

    # e "Mmh!"
    e "啊！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:830
translate chinese emmasoloending_118e23e4:

    # mc "What's up? You good?"
    mc "怎么了？没事吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:833
translate chinese emmasoloending_6f66c01a:

    # e "Yeah, I heard a glass break. It's loud..."
    e "没事，我听见了杯子摔碎的声音。声音很大……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:835
translate chinese emmasoloending_6e71dd46:

    # e "Right, the microphone in the living room!"
    e "对了，是客厅里的麦克风！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:836
translate chinese emmasoloending_bc060880:

    # e "Let me patch the signal through the laptop."
    e "我马上把信号切到电脑上来。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:841
translate chinese emmasoloending_820920a7:

    # un "{b}I said, stop it!{/b}"
    un "{b}我说了，够了！！{/b}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:842
translate chinese emmasoloending_e06c7551:

    # un "How many times do I have to tell you that they were my business partners, Nad?!"
    un "我要告诉你多少遍才行？！我们只是生意伙伴！！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:843
translate chinese emmasoloending_0ee4242f:

    # un "Just get that through your {b}empty fucking head{/b} and move on!"
    un "别他妈再想这些了，消停点吧！！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:844
translate chinese emmasoloending_d7a87d1f:

    # nad "Ahh, yes! Business partners and all that bullshit! Would it kill you to use an actual lame excuse once in a while, Rick?!"
    nad "啊啊，对对对！什么生意伙伴，都是胡扯！你想个好点的借口是会死吗，瑞克？！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:845
translate chinese emmasoloending_31a42317:

    # ri "Fucking hell! What am I supposed to tell you, then?! Do you want me to make up stories just so you can believe me?!"
    ri "去你妈的吧！那你想听我说什么啊？！我为了说服你还要专门编个故事是吗？！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:846
translate chinese emmasoloending_dd099446:

    # ri "And don't fucking act innocent here, Nadine! I know Leah isn't my daughter!"
    ri "还有，别他妈在这装无辜，娜丁！我知道莉娅不是我的女儿！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:847
translate chinese emmasoloending_33c6cdd1:

    # ri "I had nothing but one condition when I asked you to stay with me, and you couldn't even do that!"
    ri "我答应跟你在一起的时候就这么一个条件，你都做不到！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:848
translate chinese emmasoloending_6fe5b1d9:

    # nad "Leah is your flesh and blood, Rick! I have been telling you to take a DNA test!"
    nad "莉娅是你的骨肉，瑞克！我一直都跟你说，去做DNA检验！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:849
translate chinese emmasoloending_dfc9009d:

    # nad "And if she's not, what do you expect me to do?! Throw her away?!"
    nad "就算她不是，你想让我怎么办？！把她扔了？！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:862
translate chinese emmasoloending_54352ab7:

    # mc "Wait, why did you turn it off? Where are you going?"
    mc "等一下，你怎么给关了？你要去哪？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:863
translate chinese emmasoloending_3b1130fa:

    # e "That's all I needed to hear."
    e "我听这么多就已经够了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:864
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:867
translate chinese emmasoloending_5d1c7cac:

    # mc "During their conversation... there was this faint echo. What was that about?"
    mc "他们说话的时候……我听见了一点微弱的回声。那是什么情况？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:868
translate chinese emmasoloending_1a252562:

    # e "I placed another microphone inside Leah's bedroom."
    e "我在莉娅的房间里也放了麦克风。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:869
translate chinese emmasoloending_7c21a1f2:

    # mc "Does that mean... she heard everything?!"
    mc "那……她全都听见了？！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:870
translate chinese emmasoloending_a18548ed:

    # e "Yes. Unfortunately."
    e "很遗憾，是的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:873
translate chinese emmasoloending_753e8aba:

    # mc "Poor kid..."
    mc "可怜的孩子……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:876
translate chinese emmasoloending_86517e56:

    # mc "We need to do something about it, Em. Or the kid will suffer!"
    mc "我们得做点什么，小艾，不然孩子会吃苦的！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:877
translate chinese emmasoloending_813774f2:

    # e "Investigating her husband is all we have to do. Nothing more..."
    e "我们只用调查她丈夫就够了。不要多事……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:878
translate chinese emmasoloending_a77c763c:

    # mc "Oh, come on, Em~! I'm sure we can-"
    mc "拜托，小艾~！我们肯定——"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:881
translate chinese emmasoloending_14ea5125:

    # e "-This is why I never want to bring up my past. It makes me weak and hinders my work. You know that, right?"
    e "所以我才再也不想提我的过去了。会让我变得软弱，不利于我的工作。你知道的，对吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:882
translate chinese emmasoloending_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "是啊……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:883
translate chinese emmasoloending_7e6f1b80:

    # e "I don't want to argue about this, [mc]. I'm sorry."
    e "我不想再继续争论这些了，[mc!t]。抱歉。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:884
translate chinese emmasoloending_f621c530:

    # mc "*sighs* Alright, then. Go and get some rest."
    mc "*叹气* 好吧。你去休息一下吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:887
translate chinese emmasoloending_60a85da7:

    # yt "Her robotic speech again... It's been a while."
    yt "她又开始像机器人一样说话了……离上次已经很久了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:888
translate chinese emmasoloending_9e42fa57:

    # yt "I'm sure she's concerned, but..."
    yt "我确定她也很担心，但是……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:889
translate chinese emmasoloending_ef185151:

    # yt "Ah, I better not push her."
    yt "唉，我最好还是别逼她。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:902
translate chinese emmasoloending_66511eb6:

    # e "*exhales deeply*"
    e "*长叹一口气*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:908
translate chinese emmasoloending_c5df9505:

    # mc "Hey, I don't know what it is that's troubling you, but you can relax!"
    mc "嘿，不知道你在烦什么，不过最好还是放轻松点！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:909
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_10:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:910
translate chinese emmasoloending_298b95b2:

    # mc "Come on, get it off of your chest. We have time."
    mc "来吧，别憋在心里。我们有时间。跟我说说。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:911
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_11:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:914
translate chinese emmasoloending_8fe8d1ed:

    # e "I'm afraid, [mc]..."
    e "我害怕，[mc!t]……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:915
translate chinese emmasoloending_d2201d3c:

    # e "Upon meeting her, I thought we had a chance to bond. But after what I heard last night, it made me step back and hide... myself."
    e "在遇见她之后，我以为我们有机会再亲密些。但昨晚的那些，却让我开始犹豫，想把自己……藏起来。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:916
translate chinese emmasoloending_4a7d69cc:

    # e "I'm afraid to break this emotional barrier that I've built for so long..."
    e "我在身上构筑了这么久的情感屏障……我很害怕把它打破。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:917
translate chinese emmasoloending_8272e334:

    # e "Without it, there is nothing but my old self. And eventually, my emotions will take over my decisions."
    e "没了它，就只剩下过去的我。最终，我的情感会左右我的决定。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:918
translate chinese emmasoloending_2a39a014:

    # e "We fixed it, thanks to you. But where did that initially lead us to?"
    e "多亏了你，我们解决了这个问题。但这又给我们带来了什么呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:919
translate chinese emmasoloending_52f09cdc:

    # e "A conflict. And I can't afford to have any of that here, not with an innocent child like her."
    e "是冲突。我不想再看见更多冲突了，特别是不能影响到她那样天真的小孩。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:920
translate chinese emmasoloending_832afe60:

    # e "That is why we should get this over with and move on to the next one..."
    e "所以我们才应该赶快解决这件事，然后去办下一件案子……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:923
translate chinese emmasoloending_49602b66:

    # yt "Damn... I'm sure meeting this girl suddenly sparked something inside her. I saw how happy she was."
    yt "操……我很确定，遇到那个女孩突然点燃了她心里的某些东西。我亲眼看见了她有多开心。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:924
translate chinese emmasoloending_a59ca908:

    # yt "And seeing fragments of her memories made her invest a little emotion into the case. She thought it was safe to do this time."
    yt "而对往日的回忆又让她对这个案子倾注了一些感情，因为她觉得这一次，这么做还算安全。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:925
translate chinese emmasoloending_561a2af5:

    # yt "But after discovering the family's conflict last night, she... stepped back?"
    yt "但在昨晚发现了这个家里的矛盾之后，她害怕了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:926
translate chinese emmasoloending_82023cfa:

    # yt "I know that she's afraid of getting all sentimental because of what happened to us back then, but... something's wrong here..."
    yt "我知道因为过去发生在我们身上的事，她很害怕倾注太多感情，但是……有哪个地方不太对劲……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:927
translate chinese emmasoloending_05f0cf21:

    # yt "..."
    yt "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:928
translate chinese emmasoloending_53538d67:

    # yt "There must be more to it that she doesn't know... That's probably what made her step back!"
    yt "其中一定有一些连她自己都没意识到的事！所以她才害怕了！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:929
translate chinese emmasoloending_deaa2a01:

    # yt "... Maybe it's time for me to make a move again. She eventually found where she belongs, and now I'll help her find herself."
    yt "……也许我是时候再做出行动了。她找到了她的归宿，现在我就帮她找到真实的自己。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:932
translate chinese emmasoloending_28f598c8:

    # mc "I understand, but is that what you {i}really{/i} feel? Do you think hiding your true self from others will make you whole?"
    mc "我理解，但你真的是这么想的吗？你觉得在其他人面前隐藏起真实的自己，会让你变得完整？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:933
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_12:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:936
translate chinese emmasoloending_24b25b0f:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:939
translate chinese emmasoloending_47f74379:

    # mc "Take this."
    mc "给你。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:940
translate chinese emmasoloending_fb75fb31:

    # e "... What's this?"
    e "……这是什么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:941
translate chinese emmasoloending_9000b294:

    # mc "It's a letter from your mother."
    mc "是你妈妈的信。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:944
translate chinese emmasoloending_54c2132f:

    # e "What... How did you..."
    e "什么……你怎么会……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:945
translate chinese emmasoloending_d5380400:

    # mc "Hera gave it to me when we assaulted her safe-house. She told me it was my responsibility to give it to you."
    mc "这是在大闹了她的安全屋之后，赫拉给我的。她说把这个交给你是我的责任。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:946
translate chinese emmasoloending_b7f615ff:

    # mc "I know we shouldn't talk about your past, and I'm sorry for hiding it from you all this time, but I think it's about time you read it. It might help you."
    mc "我知道我们不该谈你的过去，我也很抱歉一直把这封信藏着，但我觉得你也是时候看了。可能会帮到你。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:947
translate chinese emmasoloending_6ec21722:

    # mc "I haven't opened it, don't worry."
    mc "我没有打开过，不用担心。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:950
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_13:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:953
translate chinese emmasoloending_c147f7c5:

    # e "*trembling*"
    e "*颤抖*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:956
translate chinese emmasoloending_29952dd0:

    # yt "She's shaking so bad... I've never seen her like this before."
    yt "她抖得好厉害……我以前从来没有见过她这样。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:962
translate chinese emmasoloending_6429f886:

    # e "*clenches fist*"
    e "*握紧拳头*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:965
translate chinese emmasoloending_6686ee82:

    # yt "Could this be... what she's terrified of?"
    yt "难道说……她害怕就是这个？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:968
translate chinese emmasoloending_1f1a921f:

    # e "If you were to give me this back then, I wouldn't have had the courage to open it."
    e "如果你之前把这封信给我的话，我都不会有打开它的勇气。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:971
translate chinese emmasoloending_e4eb8291:

    # e "But, even now..."
    e "但是，即使是现在……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:972
translate chinese emmasoloending_4ea90856:

    # mc "Em..."
    mc "小艾……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:975
translate chinese emmasoloending_4d2e9433:

    # mc "C-come here!"
    mc "快-快过来！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:976
translate chinese emmasoloending_822b03ba:

    # yt "Shit..."
    yt "操……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:977
translate chinese emmasoloending_184dbf9d:

    # mc "I'm sorry, I shouldn't have pushed you. Should we cancel our appointment today?"
    mc "对不起，我不该逼你的。要不今天的见面就取消了吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:978
translate chinese emmasoloending_75d20caa:

    # e "*sniffs*"
    e "*吸鼻子*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:979
translate chinese emmasoloending_0c1974f0:

    # e "N-no, no. Let's not waste any time."
    e "不-不，不用。别浪费时间了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:980
translate chinese emmasoloending_cfce055e:

    # mc "Are you sure?"
    mc "你确定吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:981
translate chinese emmasoloending_199e63ca:

    # e "Yeah, I'll be fine."
    e "对，我没事的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:985
translate chinese emmasoloending_07458a90:

    # mc "Alright then. To your \"home sweet home\", it is."
    mc "好吧。那就出发去你的甜蜜老家了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:986
translate chinese emmasoloending_d06bcd68:

    # e "Oh God... can you stop calling it that?"
    e "天啊……你能不能别这么称呼了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:987
translate chinese emmasoloending_b22ada40:

    # mc "Nope! Ahahaha!"
    mc "不行！哈哈哈哈！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:988
translate chinese emmasoloending_3378bb33:

    # e "*sighs* What are you doing to me?"
    e "*叹气* 我怎么就看上你了呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1000
translate chinese emmasoloending_a1ba2f1b:

    # mc "Pardon our intrusion-{w=0.3}{nw}"
    mc "打扰——{w=0.3}{nw}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1004
translate chinese emmasoloending_3f4ecdaa:

    # le "{b}HUWAAAAAAAAAAAHH~!{/b}" (multiple=2)
    le "{b}哇啊啊啊啊啊啊~！！{/b}" (multiple=2)

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1005
translate chinese emmasoloending_cb34145b:

    # mc "Oof!" (multiple=2)
    mc "我去！" (multiple=2)

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1008
translate chinese emmasoloending_df85a066:

    # e "How old are you again?"
    e "你几岁了啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1009
translate chinese emmasoloending_1a520cdb:

    # mc "Now that's what I call a \"warm welcome\"."
    mc "这个欢迎可真够热情的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1018
translate chinese emmasoloending_fc6d35fe:

    # le "Ah! I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!"
    le "啊！对不起，对不起，对不起！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1019
translate chinese emmasoloending_da9e12e9:

    # mc "Relax, it's my fault. Why don't you sit down?"
    mc "没事，是我的错。先坐下吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1020
translate chinese emmasoloending_26764a13:

    # le "O-okay."
    le "好-好的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1024
translate chinese emmasoloending_240d2e5b:

    # mc "Here's your plushie."
    mc "给你，你的玩具。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1025
translate chinese emmasoloending_51b5f93f:

    # mc "So... You must be Leah, huh? You sure pack a punch!"
    mc "那……你就是莉娅咯？力气可真大！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1026
translate chinese emmasoloending_7e0ad886:

    # le "Uhm... Yeah? Who are you, and how did you get in here? I thought mom went out to buy something."
    le "呃……对啊？你是谁，又是怎么进来的？妈妈不是出门买东西了吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1029
translate chinese emmasoloending_09595d37:

    # mc "Oh, that's right. My name is [mc]."
    mc "噢，对。我叫[mc!t]。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1030
translate chinese emmasoloending_237f57ec:

    # mc "And that lovely woman is my wife. And yes, we met your mom on her way out, but she told us to wait inside. So, here we are."
    mc "这边这位可爱女人是我老婆。我们在路上碰到了你妈妈，她让我们进来等，所以我们就来了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1031
translate chinese emmasoloending_924bb959:

    # mc "I believe you two already know each other?"
    mc "我想你们两个已经认识了吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1032
translate chinese emmasoloending_4ef5c79f:

    # le "She didn't tell me her name yet."
    le "她还没把名字告诉我。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1035
translate chinese emmasoloending_5a7bf374:

    # mc "You didn't even introduce yourself?!"
    mc "你连自我介绍都没做？！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1036
translate chinese emmasoloending_d2c2d153:

    # e "... Emma. My name is Emma."
    e "……艾玛。我的名字是艾玛。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1039
translate chinese emmasoloending_65ecfc56:

    # le "You really came back for me!"
    le "你真的回来找我了！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1042
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_14:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1043
translate chinese emmasoloending_ebdcd241:

    # le "... Hmm?"
    le "……嗯？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1044
translate chinese emmasoloending_0b68d601:

    # le "What's with her? Is she on her period?"
    le "她怎么了？是来大姨妈了吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1047
translate chinese emmasoloending_46ddd4fc:

    # mc "Haha! I like her, Em~! We're already partners at this point!"
    mc "哈哈！我喜欢她，小艾~！我们已经算得上是搭档了！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1050
translate chinese emmasoloending_97927fb6:

    # e "{i}*sighs* Now I'm not sure if it was a good idea to have them meet each other...{/i}"
    e "{i}*叹气* 现在我开始怀疑是不是不该让这俩人见面了……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1051
translate chinese emmasoloending_aa5cacf4:

    # e "{i}One [mc] is already a huge pain. And now, there's two of them...{/i}"
    e "{i}有一个[mc!t]就够头疼的了。现在还变成两个了……{/i}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1053
translate chinese emmasoloending_e6efde94:

    # mc "Wait, how do you know about that stuff?!"
    mc "等一下，你怎么知道那个的？！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1054
translate chinese emmasoloending_1aad0a8a:

    # le "What? About periods? My mom has them and tends to get aggressive or sulky then. Why?"
    le "什么？大姨妈吗？我妈妈就有啊，而且她一到那个时候就很爱生气。怎么了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1057
translate chinese emmasoloending_46be0793:

    # mc "How old are you?"
    mc "你几岁了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1058
translate chinese emmasoloending_6874ec6f:

    # le "I'm nine years old. Why?"
    le "我九岁了。怎么了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1061
translate chinese emmasoloending_3f8a074e:

    # mc "What's your favorite toy?"
    mc "你最喜欢的玩具是什么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1062
translate chinese emmasoloending_fbe7c024:

    # le "Them. Why?"
    le "他们。怎么了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1065
translate chinese emmasoloending_e96721d9:

    # mc "What's your favorite food?"
    mc "你最喜欢吃什么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1066
translate chinese emmasoloending_5a68c833:

    # le "None. Why?"
    le "没有喜欢吃的。怎么了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1069
translate chinese emmasoloending_9e1d8f8e:

    # mc "Do you go to school?"
    mc "你上学了吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1070
translate chinese emmasoloending_2f32b2d6:

    # le "No. Why?"
    le "没有。怎么了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1073
translate chinese emmasoloending_d122163f:

    # mc "Hey, Em! Can I have her?"
    mc "小艾！我们把她带回家呗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1074
translate chinese emmasoloending_66511eb6_1:

    # e "*exhales deeply*"
    e "*长叹一口气*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1076
translate chinese emmasoloending_3c2de676:

    # mc "Hold up... What's with those last two answers?!"
    mc "等等……最后那两个回答是什么情况？！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1077
translate chinese emmasoloending_840cdb6a:

    # le "Hmm~?"
    le "嗯~？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1082
translate chinese emmasoloending_4b688e71:

    # le "I don't eat anything aside from oatmeal and mom's everyday curry. So, I guess those two are my favorites?"
    le "我除了麦片和妈妈每天做的咖喱之外什么都不吃。所以这两个应该算是我最喜欢的了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1085
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1092
translate chinese emmasoloending_c039df5b:

    # e "*shrugs*"
    e "*耸肩*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1095
translate chinese emmasoloending_67052efc:

    # mc "Then, how about school?"
    mc "那，学校呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1098
translate chinese emmasoloending_7494eccb:

    # le "Mom said she couldn't send me to school because she didn't have money. She only gives me books to read and learn from."
    le "妈妈说她没有钱，不能让我上学。她只会给我买书，让我学习。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1101
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_15:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1104
translate chinese emmasoloending_3883af81:

    # le "But, I know she doesn't send me to school because she's embarrassed about me. She doesn't want anyone to know that I exist."
    le "但我知道，她不让我去学校，是因为她觉得我很丢脸。她不想让其他人知道我的存在。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1105
translate chinese emmasoloending_6d45d4db:

    # le "She changed when that man she wants me to call \"father\" came to live with us. I was five then."
    le "那个她想让我喊爸爸的人来家里之后，她就变了。那时候我五岁。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1106
translate chinese emmasoloending_a2a736e1:

    # le "She barely takes care of me. She was never like my mother, to begin with."
    le "她几乎都不再管我了。不过她从一开始就不像是我的妈妈。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1107
translate chinese emmasoloending_19fedcff:

    # le "Aren't parents supposed to love their kids? At least that's what the family storybooks say."
    le "父母不都是应该爱他们的孩子的吗？至少在我看的书里都是这么写的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1108
translate chinese emmasoloending_86bef52d:

    # le "My \"father\" doesn't even talk to me because my mom used to be a hooker, and he believes that I'm not his daughter."
    le "我“爸爸”根本都不和我说话，因为我妈妈以前是个妓女，他觉得我不是他的女儿。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1109
translate chinese emmasoloending_b99456c7:

    # le "And then, there's the possibility that he might be cheating on my mom."
    le "而且，他还可能背着我妈妈找小三。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1110
translate chinese emmasoloending_392a1075:

    # le "But, what can I do? They don't even care that I hear them fight."
    le "但是，我能怎么做呢？他们根本也不在乎我会听见他们吵架。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1111
translate chinese emmasoloending_f2fece37:

    # le "All I can do is crawl into a corner while my chest gets heavier and heavier. I then wait until they're done and go to sleep."
    le "我只能躲到墙角，心里越来越难受，等到他们吵完，然后去睡觉。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1112
translate chinese emmasoloending_a55cea40:

    # le "It happens every other day."
    le "每过几天都会来一次。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1115
translate chinese emmasoloending_d27ce741:

    # mc "Hey, stop talking about your parents like that."
    mc "哎，别这么说你的父母呀。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1118
translate chinese emmasoloending_942d72c4:

    # le "Parents? Which ones? I don't feel them at all. I don't even have friends just because they don't want me to."
    le "父母？谁的父母？我从来都没觉得他们是我的父母。我甚至都没有一个朋友，就因为他们不想让我交朋友。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1121
translate chinese emmasoloending_37d00744:

    # yt "Damn... She already understands what's happening. I... did not expect that at all. At least from someone her age."
    yt "天啊……她已经能理解家里的情况了。我……根本没有料到。更别说她现在的年纪了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1122
translate chinese emmasoloending_3ff7a9b1:

    # yt "She almost feels like..."
    yt "她甚至可以说非常像……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1125
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1128
translate chinese emmasoloending_d0b9b2f5:

    # mc "How did you know about... all this?"
    mc "你是怎么知道……这些的？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1129
translate chinese emmasoloending_b1bc63c7_1:

    # le "Hmm?"
    le "嗯？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1130
translate chinese emmasoloending_660eeeb2:

    # le "They were saying it themselves every fight. Repeatedly. Until I was old enough to understand what they meant."
    le "他们每次吵架的时候，都会说这些。每次都说。一直说到我长大到能理解他们说的东西。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1131
translate chinese emmasoloending_0e668edb:

    # yt "That still... doesn't explain much."
    yt "这也仍然……没让我完全明白。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1134
translate chinese emmasoloending_c18d9410:

    # e "I'm going outside."
    e "我出去一下。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1138
translate chinese emmasoloending_c3faa3d5_3:

    # "*door closes*"
    "*关门*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1141
translate chinese emmasoloending_b8702145:

    # mc "I'm gonna be right back. You stay here, okay?"
    mc "我也很快回来。你留在这，好吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1142
translate chinese emmasoloending_f5927883:

    # le "Okay~!"
    le "好~！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1145
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_7:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1157
translate chinese emmasoloending_f0ce7589:

    # mc "Hey, you good?"
    mc "没事吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1158
translate chinese emmasoloending_159cae68:

    # e "I'm sorry, I just needed some fresh air."
    e "抱歉，我需要点新鲜空气。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1161
translate chinese emmasoloending_a31c1916:

    # mc "Man... I can't believe she's that mature already."
    mc "天啊……我没想到她已经这么成熟了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1162
translate chinese emmasoloending_b33388ff:

    # e "It's more than that."
    e "不止这样。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1165
translate chinese emmasoloending_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1166
translate chinese emmasoloending_e9c91302:

    # e "Did you notice her expression as she was saying all those things?"
    e "你注意到她说那些东西的时候的表情了吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1167
translate chinese emmasoloending_30b305a3:

    # mc "Uhm... She didn't have any?"
    mc "呃……什么表情都没有啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1168
translate chinese emmasoloending_9a1b5ce2:

    # e "Exactly..."
    e "没错……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1171
translate chinese emmasoloending_0486daa0:

    # e "Leah was forced to mature with what she witnessed for years."
    e "多年来的经历，逼着莉娅成熟起来了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1172
translate chinese emmasoloending_45bed3e1:

    # e "The words she's heard from them attacked her innocence over and over until they sounded natural to her."
    e "她听见的那些东西，不断消耗着她的天真，一直到她对那些话完全没了感觉。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1173
translate chinese emmasoloending_c3d0535f:

    # mc "Damn... I feel so sorry for her."
    mc "操……我好心疼她。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1182
translate chinese emmasoloending_12840b11:

    # e "That also confirms your question from last night."
    e "这也回答了你昨晚的问题。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1183
translate chinese emmasoloending_365621f7:

    # mc "Yeah, she knows about her mother's former {i}line of work{/i}."
    mc "是啊，她知道她妈妈之前的工作。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1184
translate chinese emmasoloending_777d2b3f:

    # mc "But, it's still hard to believe that she knows what... well... a hooker means."
    mc "但是，还是很难相信，她居然知道……呃……妓女是什么意思。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1185
translate chinese emmasoloending_ae342979:

    # e "You missed one thing when we did a background check on them."
    e "你忽略了背景调查里查到的一件事。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1186
translate chinese emmasoloending_7f16e184:

    # mc "What thing?"
    mc "什么事？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1187
translate chinese emmasoloending_786bd7da:

    # e "Leah {i}did go{/i} to a primary school once, but for just over a month."
    e "莉娅{i}确实{/i}上过学，但只上了一个月。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1188
translate chinese emmasoloending_b99c7f36:

    # e "Her school report says that they never saw or heard from her again after the day she went absent. Then, a week later, they moved here."
    e "她的学校报告说，自从她不再去上课那一天之后，再也没有见过她或者听到她的消息。一个星期之后，她们就搬到了这里来。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1189
translate chinese emmasoloending_89086476:

    # mc "Oh shit..."
    mc "我操……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1190
translate chinese emmasoloending_2838f70c_2:

    # e "Mhm."
    e "嗯。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1191
translate chinese emmasoloending_a6c0b1d4:

    # e "Considering that Nadine was quite popular in her former line of work..."
    e "考虑到娜丁在她之前的行当里相当有名……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1192
translate chinese emmasoloending_075bf20b:

    # e "... I can guarantee that Leah was being humiliated and bullied while attending said school."
    e "……我可以确定地说，莉娅在上学的时候受到了羞辱和霸凌。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1193
translate chinese emmasoloending_ae1547a3:

    # e "There's also a high chance that it was not by the students, but rather by their parents."
    e "羞辱她的人还很可能不是学生，而是他们的父母。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1194
translate chinese emmasoloending_83816f75:

    # mc "Or even her teacher..."
    mc "甚至可能是她的老师……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1195
translate chinese emmasoloending_235d02ea:

    # e "Based on what Leah said, it seems that she endured it well enough, all things considered, but Nadine made her stop."
    e "根据莉娅的说法，尽管如此，她似乎也可以忍受，但是娜丁不让她继续上学了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1196
translate chinese emmasoloending_32ea3eda:

    # e "Which was the right thing to do to protect her, but... I don't think that's the reason."
    e "为了保护她，这是正确的决定。但是……我不觉得真的是这个原因。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1199
translate chinese emmasoloending_0934760e:

    # mc "God... fucking-"
    mc "我的……天啊……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1200
translate chinese emmasoloending_77aa7e5d:

    # mc "I don't know what to say to her."
    mc "我不知道该对她说什么了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1201
translate chinese emmasoloending_d8108bb5:

    # e "Leave her be. We will remind her of those memories if it's true, which could compromise our job."
    e "别管了。如果真是那样，我们就会让她想起过去，可能会影响我们的工作。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1202
translate chinese emmasoloending_0fb94f2f:

    # e "In any case, she's not our focus – her father is."
    e "不管怎么说，她不是重点，她爸爸才是。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1203
translate chinese emmasoloending_85b88559:

    # mc "*sighs* I know..."
    mc "*叹气* 我知道……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1206
translate chinese emmasoloending_414c69b5:

    # mc "So? What's the plan?"
    mc "所以呢？计划是什么？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1207
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_16:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1208
translate chinese emmasoloending_b05f5f58:

    # e "Leave that to me."
    e "交给我吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1218
translate chinese emmasoloending_fd9afc1e:

    # mc "There he is!"
    mc "看见他了！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1219
translate chinese emmasoloending_a4d2d160:

    # mc "Did he just... go in and out?"
    mc "他是不是……刚进去就出来了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1220
translate chinese emmasoloending_2e367562:

    # e "... Yes. Nadine told me he only stays here during his days off."
    e "……是的。娜丁跟我说，他只有在休息的日子才会住在这里。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1221
translate chinese emmasoloending_048af04f:

    # e "While that's shady, he reassured Nadine that it's for \"work reasons\". And he always comes back around this hour."
    e "这就已经很可疑了，他跟娜丁解释说，这么做是“工作原因”。而且他一直都是到了这么晚才回来。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1222
translate chinese emmasoloending_046dc241:

    # mc "So, if we were to get evidence of his affair, what's next?"
    mc "如果我们能搞到他出轨的证据，之后要怎么做？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1223
translate chinese emmasoloending_dac12661:

    # e "Present it to Nadine and be done with it. That's all she asked for, so that's where the job ends."
    e "把证据交给娜丁就够了。她的要求就这么多，所以我们的工作到那也就结束了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1226
translate chinese emmasoloending_f506e4fb:

    # e "When this is over, I'll... never return to this place again..."
    e "等这事办完了，我就……再也不会回到这里了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1229
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_8:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1232
translate chinese emmasoloending_00450ec6:

    # e "Follow him, but don't get too close."
    e "跟着他，但别离得太近。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1233
translate chinese emmasoloending_1be205bc:

    # mc "You got it!"
    mc "收到！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1242
translate chinese emmasoloending_74a0f9a9:

    # mc "... It's been five minutes. What is he waiting for?"
    mc "……已经五分钟了。他在等什么呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1243
translate chinese emmasoloending_b80df765:

    # e "Not \"what\", but \"who\"."
    e "不是“什么”，而是“谁”。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1244
translate chinese emmasoloending_91b0130e:

    # e "Just have your camera ready."
    e "准备好相机。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1245
translate chinese emmasoloending_af4546c9:

    # mc "On standby. Awaiting your orders, ma'am!"
    mc "已经就位了。只等你一声令下，长官！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1248
translate chinese emmasoloending_4e617e40:

    # e "*chuckles* Can you stop saying that every time?"
    e "*轻笑* 你能不能别每次都这么说？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1249
translate chinese emmasoloending_de3b019c:

    # mc "What? It sounds cool!"
    mc "怎么？这样很酷的啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1250
translate chinese emmasoloending_47ca211c:

    # e "We are not in the military, sweetheart."
    e "我们又不是当兵的，亲爱的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1253
translate chinese emmasoloending_8ff11070:

    # mc "Hoo..."
    mc "嚯……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1256
translate chinese emmasoloending_715361c8:

    # mc "Hohohooo~!"
    mc "吼吼吼~！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1257
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b40a022_1:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "啊？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1258
translate chinese emmasoloending_f324f134:

    # mc "Say that again!"
    mc "再说一遍！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1259
translate chinese emmasoloending_7dc7cf58:

    # e "What? Sweetheart?"
    e "什么？亲爱的？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1260
translate chinese emmasoloending_e9a28e46:

    # mc "Yeah!"
    mc "对！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1263
translate chinese emmasoloending_76c1c8f3:

    # e "*smirks*"
    e "*冷笑*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1266
translate chinese emmasoloending_74a60cc3:

    # e "My, my... sweetheart..."
    e "我最亲爱的……老公……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1267
translate chinese emmasoloending_808fae3a:

    # mc "Sh-shit, I'm getting hard..."
    mc "不-不好，我要硬了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1268
translate chinese emmasoloending_f1a4f2f5:

    # e "Then why don't you slide it in me like you always do?"
    e "那你可以跟往常一样，直接插进来呀？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1269
translate chinese emmasoloending_80c07334:

    # mc "*shivers* F-fuck... Just wait till we get back home..."
    mc "*颤抖* 操……等我们回家之后……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1270
translate chinese emmasoloending_086f25d5:

    # e "No, right here, right now!"
    e "不行，就这里，就现在！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1271
translate chinese emmasoloending_5d9a4339:

    # mc "Y-you're kidding, right?"
    mc "你-你开玩笑的吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1274
translate chinese emmasoloending_0dec3650:

    # e "*giggles* Yes, I would never do that."
    e "*笑* 是啊，我永远不可能变成那样的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1275
translate chinese emmasoloending_76d31b0e:

    # mc "Phew... that got me sweating."
    mc "还好……你要吓死我了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1276
translate chinese emmasoloending_d29a0232:

    # e "You're exaggerating, [mc]."
    e "你太夸张了，[mc!t]。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1277
translate chinese emmasoloending_3dc221a5:

    # mc "No, I'm not!"
    mc "我没有！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1278
translate chinese emmasoloending_b14e38b6:

    # e "Why are you like this, then?"
    e "那你为什么这样呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1279
translate chinese emmasoloending_1ac17111:

    # mc "Well, that's because you don't look like the type to say that stuff. And yet, you made it work somehow! Ahaha!"
    mc "嗯，因为你不像是说那种话的人，但是不知怎么的还效果挺好的！哈哈哈！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1280
translate chinese emmasoloending_4b2ace03:

    # e "Ah, you dummy..."
    e "笨蛋……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1283
translate chinese emmasoloending_b3436524:

    # mc "Hold up. Someone's on the way to his vehicle."
    mc "等等。有人在往他的车那边走。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1301
translate chinese emmasoloending_c4c98de2:

    # mc "I'll be damned! Dude's not even trying to hide it!"
    mc "我的天啊！这哥们一点藏着掖着的意思都没有！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1302
translate chinese emmasoloending_c5e6ed00:

    # e "... That means he doesn't care."
    e "……这代表他根本不在乎。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1303
translate chinese emmasoloending_0c1a107f:

    # mc "Well? I think there's no need to follow him further with these, right?"
    mc "行吧，有了这些，应该也不用再继续跟踪他了吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1304
translate chinese emmasoloending_8d41c26d:

    # e "... Yes."
    e "……是的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1307
translate chinese emmasoloending_e42b4045:

    # mc "Em?"
    mc "小艾？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1310
translate chinese emmasoloending_c0d97f6b:

    # e "And here... I was hoping that Nadine was wrong..."
    e "我居然还……还希望娜丁想多了……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1311
translate chinese emmasoloending_76d14845:

    # e "I thought it was all just..."
    e "我以为一切都是……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1312
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_9:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1313
translate chinese emmasoloending_00a5aa82:

    # mc "That single meeting triggered something inside you, hasn't it?"
    mc "遇见她之后，你就变了，对吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1314
translate chinese emmasoloending_fc0e4faa:

    # mc "Even with how different your personalities are, you saw yourself in her."
    mc "哪怕你们两个的性格天差地别，你也在她身上看见了你自己的影子。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1315
translate chinese emmasoloending_3482c9db:

    # mc "I've never seen you so happy when talking about someone, Em."
    mc "我从来没见过你在谈到某个人的时候那么开心，小艾。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1316
translate chinese emmasoloending_e4fee22d:

    # mc "Your expression did not say it, but the joy in your voice gave it away."
    mc "你的表情没有露馅，但是声音里的高兴却藏不住。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1317
translate chinese emmasoloending_40fe4858:

    # mc "You care for the kid, don't you? You even told her that you'd come back."
    mc "你很在乎那个孩子，对吧？你甚至还跟她说你会回来。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1318
translate chinese emmasoloending_5d3770d4:

    # mc "No matter how faint that feeling was, the kid was longing for you, Em."
    mc "不管那种感觉有多微弱，那个孩子也在渴望着你，小艾。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1319
translate chinese emmasoloending_be47ba89:

    # mc "Come on. Be honest with me."
    mc "拜托，小艾。跟我说实话。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1322
translate chinese emmasoloending_d3ab0911:

    # e "... Ever since you saved me, I promised myself that I would never lie to you."
    e "……自从你救了我之后，我就对自己发誓，永远不会骗你。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1323
translate chinese emmasoloending_e94bcbf6:

    # e "But... I don't know how I feel about Leah, [mc]."
    e "但是……我也不知道我是怎么看莉娅的，[mc!t]。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1324
translate chinese emmasoloending_517c7fe4:

    # e "I care for her, yes. I am not {i}that{/i} heartless."
    e "我是在乎她，没错。我没有{i}那么{/i}无情。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1325
translate chinese emmasoloending_a5481047:

    # e "I know from the bottom of my heart that she's just a kid I met the other day. Yet, why do I feel this strange anxiety in my chest?"
    e "我打心底清楚，她只是我某一天碰见的一个小孩而已。可是，这股在我心里的奇怪躁动又到底是什么呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1326
translate chinese emmasoloending_914b414c:

    # mc "You know, you may have found where you finally belong, but you never found yourself, Em..."
    mc "你可能找到了你最终的归宿，但你从来没有找到你自己，小艾……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1329
translate chinese emmasoloending_2f6d9795:

    # e "W-what do you mean by that?"
    e "你-你什么意思？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1332
translate chinese emmasoloending_9681abe0:

    # mc "*sighs* Let's just go back to Nadine and {i}get this over with{/i}."
    mc "*叹气* 我们就回去找娜丁，赶快{i}把这事给解决了吧{/i}。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1335
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_17:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1336
translate chinese emmasoloending_5c090e89:

    # mc "...."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1339
translate chinese emmasoloending_51c26401:

    # mc "When we get home, you owe me a rice omelet."
    mc "我们回家之后，你可得给我做蛋包饭。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1340
translate chinese emmasoloending_918c4d6e:

    # e "*chuckles* Of course."
    e "*笑* 当然。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1349
translate chinese emmasoloending_0ca6be26:

    # nad "So, did you find anything suspicious about Rick?"
    nad "所以，关于瑞克，你们有找到什么可疑的地方吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1352
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_10:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1353
translate chinese emmasoloending_2838f70c_3:

    # e "Mhm."
    e "嗯。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1357
translate chinese emmasoloending_e40af524:

    # mc "You... might wanna see these."
    mc "你……看一下吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1360
translate chinese emmasoloending_13f53a15:

    # nad "..."
    nad "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1361
translate chinese emmasoloending_c0979d29:

    # nad "...."
    nad "…………"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1362
translate chinese emmasoloending_398458e5:

    # nad "My... word..."
    nad "我……说的……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1363
translate chinese emmasoloending_042bfb46:

    # mc "Your assumptions were right."
    mc "你的猜想是正确的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1364
translate chinese emmasoloending_5f959e53:

    # e "We did not expect to find anything on the first day, but it seems like he's not trying to hide it from anyone."
    e "我们没想着在第一天就发现什么，但是，他似乎根本不想瞒着任何人。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1365
translate chinese emmasoloending_6fc9b2c5:

    # e "Aside from you, of course."
    e "当然，你除外。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1366
translate chinese emmasoloending_fa97e35c:

    # e "I'm sorry, Nadine."
    e "很遗憾，娜丁。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1369
translate chinese emmasoloending_9378262b:

    # nad "*sobs* So that's why he keeps anyone away from the child and me. We're almost like his prisoners, huh?"
    nad "*抽泣* 所以他才不让我和孩子跟任何人接触。我们就像他的囚犯一样，是吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1370
translate chinese emmasoloending_ad5d7b6e:

    # e "Is there anything more you'd like us to do before we consider this case closed?"
    e "在正式结案之前，你还有什么想让我们做的吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1373
translate chinese emmasoloending_27de44a2:

    # nad "*sobs* No... I don't think so... I can handle the rest. I appreciate your help, officer Meyer."
    nad "*抽泣* 没了……没有了……我可以处理剩下的事。感谢你的帮助，梅耶警官。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1374
translate chinese emmasoloending_c1c8835b:

    # e "Alright. You have my contact number if you require further assistance."
    e "好的。如果你需要其他帮助的话，给我打电话。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1375
translate chinese emmasoloending_829ef470:

    # nad "Okay..."
    nad "好的……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1376
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_18:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1379
translate chinese emmasoloending_bebe6ee5:

    # e "May I ask something?"
    e "我可以问个问题吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1380
translate chinese emmasoloending_05433ee5:

    # nad "Yes?"
    nad "怎么了？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1381
translate chinese emmasoloending_9061336b:

    # e "Now that you have that information, what will you do?"
    e "既然你现在已经知道了，打算怎么办？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1382
translate chinese emmasoloending_52611ba8:

    # nad "I guess... I need to find a new life. I can take care of the divorce process. You don't need to worry about that."
    nad "我想……我要开始新的生活。我能把离婚的事处理好的。你不用担心。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1385
translate chinese emmasoloending_7e228acc:

    # e "If you say so."
    e "好吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1388
translate chinese emmasoloending_26cce7b3:

    # e "Can we enter Leah's room for a minute? I wanted to leave her a little gift."
    e "我们可以进一下莉娅的房间吗？我想给她一个小礼物。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1389
translate chinese emmasoloending_d50b3381:

    # nad "I think she's already asleep, but help yourselves."
    nad "她应该已经睡觉了，不过请便吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1399
translate chinese emmasoloending_0ca39b00:

    # le "*snores lightly*"
    le "*轻轻打鼾*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1400
translate chinese emmasoloending_d283c6fc:

    # mc "Oh boy... You can hear that clearly in this soundless room."
    mc "我天……这里这么安静，能听得一清二楚。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1406
translate chinese emmasoloending_72a33094_19:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1422
translate chinese emmasoloending_17b632b0:

    # e "Let's go."
    e "走吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1423
translate chinese emmasoloending_2b35b6fe_11:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1426
translate chinese emmasoloending_a9504224:

    # mc "*whispers* Goodbye, partner..."
    mc "*低语* 再见了，搭档……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1451
translate chinese emmasoloending_327becd5:

    # nad "*mumbling* No, no. Please, no."
    nad "*咕哝* 不，不。求你了，不要。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1452
translate chinese emmasoloending_61eac991:

    # nad "*mumbling* I told you he's cheating on you!"
    nad "*咕哝* 我都跟你说了他有小三！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1453
translate chinese emmasoloending_03e43f3d:

    # nad "*mumbling* No, I... He loves me. He would never do that to me."
    nad "*咕哝* 不，我……他爱我。他绝对不会背叛我的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1454
translate chinese emmasoloending_4c5138f5:

    # nad "*mumbling* Loves you?! You failed him! He told you to abandon Leah, but you didn't do it!"
    nad "*咕哝* 爱你？！你让他失望了！他跟你说了，让你扔掉莉娅。但你不听！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1455
translate chinese emmasoloending_bc2234e6:

    # nad "*mumbling* L-Leah is my daughter. Leah is my daughter. Leah is my daughter. Leah is my daughter."
    nad "*咕哝* 莉-莉娅是我的女儿。莉娅是我的女儿。莉娅是我的女儿。莉娅是我的女儿。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1456
translate chinese emmasoloending_3faaca9b:

    # nad "*mumbling* Daughter of a hooker, yes, yes, {b}YES{/b}. I should throw her away."
    nad "*咕哝* 是妓女的女儿，对，对，{b}对{/b}。我应该把她扔掉。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1457
translate chinese emmasoloending_7adb359f:

    # nad "*mumbling* No, {b}kill{/b} her..."
    nad "*咕哝* 不，{b}杀{/b}了她。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1458
translate chinese emmasoloending_8fff15d8:

    # nad "*mumbling* No, I can't do that to Leah. She's my daughter."
    nad "*咕哝* 不行，我不能那样对莉娅。她是我女儿。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1459
translate chinese emmasoloending_86b5232f:

    # nad "*mumbling* Daughter of a hooker. Daughter of a hooker. Daughter of a hooker. {b}I am a hooker.{/b}"
    nad "*咕哝* 妓女的女儿。妓女的女儿。妓女的女儿。{b}我是妓女。{/b}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1460
translate chinese emmasoloending_f3f3ad56:

    # nad "*mumbling* S-stop..."
    nad "*咕哝* 停-停下……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1461
translate chinese emmasoloending_a782788a:

    # nad "*mumbling* Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop it..."
    nad "*咕哝* 停下，停下，停下，停下，快停下……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1464
translate chinese emmasoloending_08cd7e5d:

    # nad "Huh..."
    nad "啊……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1474
translate chinese emmasoloending_15ba2562:

    # nad "Hee..."
    nad "嘿嘿……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1475
translate chinese emmasoloending_bb0ae44f:

    # nad "{b}Heheheheee~!{/b}"
    nad "{b}嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿~！{/b}"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1485
translate chinese emmasoloending_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1486
translate chinese emmasoloending_5f9b772e:

    # "...."
    "…………"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1488
translate chinese emmasoloending_21ef9d09:

    # nad "Rick?"
    nad "瑞克？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1489
translate chinese emmasoloending_16d61273:

    # nad "*giggles* I was so sorry for my outburst yesterday, honey~. I don't know what I was thinking."
    nad "*笑* 真的很对不起，我昨天朝你发火了，亲爱的~。我也不知道我脑子出了什么问题。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1490
translate chinese emmasoloending_0ee07cab:

    # nad "We were meant for each other. You know that. So please, come over soon so I can show you how much I love you..."
    nad "我们是天生一对，你也知道的。请你赶快过来吧，我要向你展示一下我有多爱你……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1491
translate chinese emmasoloending_d41d4a5f:

    # nad "Here's a hint – I'm not wearing any underwear right now..."
    nad "给你个提示：我现在没有穿内衣……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1493
translate chinese emmasoloending_8e9aad0e:

    # "*click*"
    "*挂断*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1496
translate chinese emmasoloending_7af9e899:

    # nad "And they lived... happily... ever... after..."
    nad "之后……他们……过上了……幸福的生活……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1510
translate chinese emmaroleplay_a6cbd03d:

    # mc "Here's to another successful case!"
    mc "敬又解决了一件案子！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1511
translate chinese emmaroleplay_94a92282:

    # e "Mhm!"
    e "嗯！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1523
translate chinese emmaroleplay_28fd1207:

    # mc "Well? It wasn't so hard this time around, was it?"
    mc "怎么样？这次没什么难度，对吧？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1524
translate chinese emmaroleplay_14270fa5:

    # e "That's easy for you to say."
    e "你说得倒是轻松。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1525
translate chinese emmaroleplay_ec91be8f:

    # mc "Yeah... You sure went through an emotional breakdown."
    mc "是啊……这回你在情感上还真受了不小打击。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1526
translate chinese emmaroleplay_ec954430:

    # e "I wouldn't go as far as that. I think I was just... confused."
    e "也没那么夸张。我觉得我就是……很疑惑。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1527
translate chinese emmaroleplay_0f1ffdf2:

    # mc "Mentally?"
    mc "心理上？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1528
translate chinese emmaroleplay_135aac44:

    # e "Emotionally."
    e "情感上。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1529
translate chinese emmaroleplay_7e1398bb:

    # e "So much of the emotional luggage came back to me the moment I entered the house, and..."
    e "我走进那个房子的时候，一下子想起了很多东西，还有……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1530
translate chinese emmaroleplay_eb170beb:

    # mc "... The kid was the final nail in the coffin, right? That's why you got drawn in, even though you didn't intend to."
    mc "……那个小孩是最重要的因素，对吧？所以即使你不想，也还是被卷进去了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1531
translate chinese emmaroleplay_ccc05911:

    # e "*sighs* Why am I so weak..."
    e "*叹气* 为什么我会这么脆弱……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1534
translate chinese emmaroleplay_0c3e3e73:

    # mc "Hey there... We're not here to get all gloomy."
    mc "好啦，好啦……现在可不是伤心的时候。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1537
translate chinese emmaroleplay_511bc74f:

    # mc "And actually, I wouldn't say you're weak, but rather, sensitive."
    mc "还有呢，我不觉得你脆弱，更合适的说法是，敏感。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1540
translate chinese emmaroleplay_6a773bd9:

    # mc "And you know, being {i}sensitive{/i} can be a good thing."
    mc "你也知道，有时候{i}敏感{/i}也算是好事，你觉得呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1543
translate chinese emmaroleplay_49664f76:

    # yt "After all this time, I still can't believe I got to reunite with my childhood love, who grew up to be such a beautiful and capable young woman."
    yt "过了这么久，我还是不敢相信我和我童年的爱人重聚了，她还变成了一个美丽、能干的女人。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1544
translate chinese emmaroleplay_297cb25e:

    # yt "Sure, it did require a lot of sacrifices to get to where we are, on both ends."
    yt "当然，我们为了走到这一步，双方都牺牲了很多。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:1545
translate chinese emmaroleplay_e6a390e0:

