translate chinese emmaroleplay_baf3ac9d:

    # ju "To top it off, he's currently serving a fifteen-year sentence for aggravated assault and battery."
    ju "不仅如此，他目前还因为严重伤害罪和殴打罪，正在服15年的刑期。"

