translate chinese emmaroleplay_020abf77:

    # e "June is here to inspect the house and our living conditions to see if we are fit to be Leah's foster family."
    e "她来这是为了视察我们的房子和生活条件，判断我们可不可以成为莉娅的寄养家庭。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:2347
