    # f "Thanks, Lily!"
    f "谢了，莉莉！"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3707
translate chinese emmaroleplay_ef354762:

    # l "You better be prepared, then. Winter has yet to come."
    l "那你可得准备好了。冬天还没到呢。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3711
translate chinese emmaroleplay_4a3ec829:

    # mc "Oh... Lily, huh? She left the burger shack before me, so I guess it must've been Freya's idea to follow her."
    mc "噢……是莉莉啊？她比我还先离开汉堡店，那应该是芙蕾雅提议去她那边的吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3712
translate chinese emmaroleplay_29782e6e:

    # k "I see. While I respect their choice, I'll have to tell Jess about this. She was worried about them."
    k "我明白了。尽管我尊重她们的选择，我还是得把这事告诉婕斯。她可是担心坏了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3713
translate chinese emmaroleplay_38a18b83:

    # mc "If it's Jess, I think it's alright."
    mc "如果是婕斯的话，我觉得没问题。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3716
translate chinese emmaroleplay_baa635e0:

    # e "How about the others?"
    e "那其他人呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3717
translate chinese emmaroleplay_e5561875:

    # k "Before you left, Glenn told me that I could use Gwen's help, so I eventually hired her to work for me."
    k "你们离开之前，格伦跟我说，格温可以帮我的忙，所以我后来让她到我这里工作了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3721
translate chinese emmaroleplay_ad7174ae:

    # k "She's been incredibly consistent over the past few years."
    k "可以说……她这几年来始终如一。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3722
translate chinese emmaroleplay_b53f281d:

    # k "An excellent, overachieving employee that doesn't create any workplace drama. What's more to like?"
    k "她是个勤奋努力的杰出员工。在公司里不会惹出任何麻烦。还能要求更多吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3723
translate chinese emmaroleplay_f9855f49:

    # mc "*chuckles* That sounds like Gwen, alright..."
    mc "*轻笑* 确实一听就知道是格温……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3724
translate chinese emmaroleplay_60cbca51:

    # e "Which is why I wonder how she lost her company."
    e "所以我才奇怪为什么她丢掉了她的公司。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3725
translate chinese emmaroleplay_9a364fd1:

    # mc "You don't know?"
    mc "你不知道吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3726
translate chinese emmaroleplay_01886727:

    # e "No, she never talked about it with me, but Aine may have some idea. After all, she worked under Gwen for quite some time."
    e "嗯，她从来没跟我说过。不过艾妮可能了解一些，毕竟她在格温那边工作过很久。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3727
translate chinese emmaroleplay_5693a819:

    # mc "Huh..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3730
translate chinese emmaroleplay_3bb22729:

    # k "Sky was really heartbroken when you left, you know?"
    k "你走的时候，斯凯心都碎了，你知道吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3731
translate chinese emmaroleplay_24b25b0f_2:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3732
translate chinese emmaroleplay_8e542298:

    # k "She moved on, but visit her when you have time, [mc]. I'm sure she will be happy to see you."
    k "她已经放下了，但有时间的时候一定去看看她，[mc!t]。她看到你肯定会很高兴的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3733
translate chinese emmaroleplay_566f3e14:

    # mc "Mhm, I will."
    mc "嗯，我会的。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3737
translate chinese emmaroleplay_086ce272:

    # k "Aside from Gwen and Sky, there's nothing noteworthy. Everyone is carrying on with their lives as usual."
    k "除了格温和斯凯，其他没什么值得说的了。大家都过着和往常一样的生活。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3738
translate chinese emmaroleplay_f5094ce1:

    # mc "How about... Hera?"
    mc "那……赫拉呢？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3741
translate chinese emmaroleplay_7406f7dc:

    # k "It's my fight now. Whatever happens, it is my responsibility to carry it. So, take her off your worries."
    k "这现在是我一个人的战斗了。不管发生什么，我都有责任去承担。所以你不要再去想她的事了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3742
translate chinese emmaroleplay_f16c798b:

    # mc "If you say so."
    mc "好吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3745
translate chinese emmaroleplay_9952b3ac:

    # k "Well? Now then..."
    k "好了，现在是不是该……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3746
translate chinese emmaroleplay_209bac70:

    # mc "Just... don't put too much pressure on her, okay?"
    mc "你……别给她太多压力，好吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3747
translate chinese emmaroleplay_d8e78b78:

    # e "\"Pressure on you\", you mean."
    e "你是想说别给你太多压力吧。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3750
translate chinese emmaroleplay_b9cf47e0:

    # mc "I'm gonna be a dad now."
    mc "我要当爸爸了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3753
translate chinese emmaroleplay_311046b3:

    # k "I know..." (multiple=2)
    k "我知道……" (multiple=2)

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3754
translate chinese emmaroleplay_85834b72:

    # e "We know..." (multiple=2)
    e "我们知道……" (multiple=2)

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3755
translate chinese emmaroleplay_8bc11866:

    # k "That's why we need you to prepare for it."
    k "所以我们才需要你做好准备。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:3761
translate chinese emmaroleplay_e1e57b6c_1:

    # le "Rraaawrrr~!"
    le "嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷~！"

