# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5441
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_38fe8b71:

    # ee "She said we can, as long as we are not the one who starts it, but I don't really want to."
    ee "她是说过只要不是我们主动挑起的，那打起来也没关系，但我真的不想开战。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5442
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_913a20e5:

    # ee "Also, I don't have such a thing as \"pumped\" in my data. Mind telling me what that is?"
    ee "另外，我的数据里没有“兴奋”这种东西。可以告诉我那是什么吗？"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5443
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_64776010:

    # ma "Yeah, you're losing your cool, alright."
    ma "看来你确实是怕了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5444
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_6ef7dc19:

    # ee "I can't take my eyes off of this. It's beautiful."
    ee "我的眼睛都要移不开了。真是美丽。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5445
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_a3164575:

    # ma "Hah! Sure... You can't see it, though..."
