# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5481
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_7dde45d0:

    # am "I believe we've already met once, but it's good to see you again, Leah."
    am "我们已经见过一次了，但能再见还是很高兴的，莉娅。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5485
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_e2a07554:

    # ma "It's been a century since I last saw {i}you{/i}, Mistress. Please, pardon my audacity."
    ma "而我上次见到{i}你{/i}已经是一个世纪之前了，主人。还请原谅我的无礼。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5486
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_cba69cd8:

    # ee "Mistress..."
    ee "主人……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5487
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_261f1e7a:

    # am "I told you to stop doing that, Maya. I'm still {i}me{/i}, no matter what form."
    am "我跟你说了别这样了，玛雅。不管是什么形态，我依旧是{i}我{/i}。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5488
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_7fdca207:

    # ma "But..."
    ma "但是……"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5489
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_c23ab73a:

    # am "Come on. Please, stand up. We should not waste time."
    am "好了，请站起来吧。我们不该浪费时间。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5492
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_d04c8822:

    # am "I've returned for you, and you must come with us, Leah."
    am "我是回来找你的，你也必须跟我们走，莉娅。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5493
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_a09428c2:

    # am "I know you have many questions, and I'll explain all of this later, but we should not stay here for long."
    am "我知道你有很多问题，我之后会解释这一切的。但我们不该在这里久留。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5494
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_c95aa634:

    # le "And what if I don't want to? I have a family here. I don't need anything else."
    le "那我要是说不呢？这里有我的家人。我不需要其他东西了。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5497
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_a3b20cc0:

    # am "You must. The longer you stay here, the higher the chance this place will become chaos."
    am "你必须来。你在这里待得越久，这里就越有可能陷入混沌。"

# game/emmasoloending.rpy:5501
translate chinese emmapreggospecial_ad918c0d:

    # am "Furthermore, this is the future that Emma and [mc] chose for you years ago, Leah."
    am "而且，这也是艾玛和[mc!t]很多年之前就为你选择好的未来，莉娅。"

